<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Alkitab Bahasa Ansus</book>
  <para style="h">Markusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Markusi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Markusi</para>
  <para style="mt2">ARERA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARKUSI</para>
  <para style="is">Kawio Aduna We Arera na Markusi</para>
  <para style="ip">Arera Weweng na Markusi nina pa, kewio kangkuna retenang tonina: “Arera Weweng parari Yesus Kristusi, Allah Antung pai ainina pa.” Na Kawio Weweng ne denyawa parari Yesusi we I wo nyontarai we anekurayang kia kong wemambiri. Ne mambiri pa denyawa na totoi denyau nyontarai paya kong na ne paya we dedawa semi-semi paya pa, mae na dupirandeni sasari pa. Yesusi denyawi ne taraipai we Kumai Nyontarai we dong ne taraipai we pikika imbaro nyontarai neya entampira warui sasaripai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kawio parari Yesusi na weraung nini pa, soi na wedea kong anyuing wa. Yesusi ne mariwa nyaripa ai kewio kangkuna pa warui pitoai kewiora pa kong Ne anyaupa. Retenang mamo kewio katea parari Yoanesi we webaptisi kawasa pai, kong parari Yesusi webaptisi pa, kong parari Nyombatangpai soi Yesuspa. Weraung Markusi nini pai, kewio pitau parari mariwa Yesusi nyaripa, aino parari nyari nyontarai esui paya empanang pa kong parari ne anyau denyau pa. Na rirang we pui na weraung Markusinei soi parari pitaubai Yesusi deduta pa na nunei pa. Piwe baba na kawio yana pa parari Yeroi na aitabapai, keda mae tewa na kaida rarong pa eampa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na waya bototoi we pui na Markusi nini pai mamo we soi Arera Markusi nini soi wami, mana nyontarai eaya pei.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arera Markusi tarainei kiutua tonina:</para>
  <para style="io1">Repa 1:1-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusi mariwa riupa we nyotarai paya na Galilea 1:14—9:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusi ria na Galilea to Yerusalemi 10:1-52</para>
  <para style="io1">A mingku wepui na Yerusalemi kong awa kikeu na yana pa 11:1—15:47</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusi tewa warui kaida pa 16:1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusi denyawi ne tarai pai kong wieita to rora-marising 16:9-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Arera Parari Yoanis Pembaptisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-6">Mat. 3:1-6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 3:11-12">11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3-6">Luk. 3:3-6</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:15-17">15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Arera Weweng parari Yesus Kristusi, Allai Antung pai ainina pa. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Arera Weweng yana pa parari na pampongpa nabi Yesayai soi na weraung mamarang pai doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mesanekakepana, Yemi Neu mampaing pei we pempong Au.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal. 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">I ingkai nyari rangpaia menyena we Au.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Nyontarai yani pai yau pampang na mapang wane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Monyena rangpai we Seni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Bong rangpai yeriwang we I.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Yes. 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Toyanapa Yoanis Pembaptisi meti na mapangpai kong wiuwua doyo: “Mesanetaweri warui mene sasari pa mae metong menetarai pa we ewebaptisi mia kong Allai ingkai dupirandeni mene sasari pa.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Interi nyontarai na raora Yudea tantenang kong na bendari Yerusalemi empau enda wurima. Mae ya endoao ene sasaripa we Allai. Impaina Yoanis webaptisi ya na maria Yordani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yoanisi ne asungpa na unta netuing kong wai dingkae anerabuapai na piaung rerawa mae piwe dangpei kerayami kong dunung andiwa dukaru pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Raj. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />I wiuwua doyo: “Ingkai nyontarai pei riatuwa yau ma, I piaya raweing yau. Etuang we eyepa ne wai aebampa mamo emai wa. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Yau ewebaptisi mia na maria, mana I ingkai webaptisi mia na Duainunung Mamarang pai.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoanisi webaptisi Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-23">Luk. 3:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:32-34">Yoh. 1:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Na a yani pai Yesusi ria na Nasareti ma na raora Galilea, kong Yoanis webaptisi I na maria Yordani.<figure style="fig" file="CN01656b.TIF" size="col" ref="1:9">Yoanesi webaptisi Yesusi na maria Yordani</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Awe I meti warui mariapai pa, I reo rorapai tebau kong Allai ne Duainunung Mamarang pai perari aya mandung wia mawau meoi na I. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Interi nyondaupui pei kewio na rora-marising pai maweu doyo, “Neu Kumai Aneuwiwuti pa Au, Auno aneuweng Au pa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Kej. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mzm. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:7">Yes. 42:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk. 3:22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:35">9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyombatang sou Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Na ayani to Duainunung Mamarang pai dara Yesusi to mapang wanea. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Na mapangpai I nyai woroi ape piakodu, I nyaina yana na piaung we na ri pa enemadu pa kuira mae mampang paya embesarawiri I. Na yana tato Nyombatang sou I.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus denyawi na Galilea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Na awe Yoanisi piana entapuri eampa Yesusi riato Galilea we wiuwu Allai ne Arera Weweng pa, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />kewio doyo, “A we Allai do riu we Mananu pa piana maito. Mesanetaweri kong mendoaoa we Arera Weweng pai!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat. 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 4:17">4:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yau ne weetuari paya we retenang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk. 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Na awe Yesusi ria rire kareng ruru Galilea arawa pa, I reo Simoni kong Andariasi, Simoni neta pai. Asaru umuna erang na ruru wadi, tutu asaru mamo mamung diang di asaru. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesusi kewio we asaru doyo, “Mundama murua Yau, mae ingkai Yong maru mumbe mantapu nyontarai we etua Yau.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Interi umpika erangpa mae uruari. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Kong Yesusi riatopong woroi katea mamo reo Yakobusi kong Yoanisi, Sebedeusi ne kumai pa asaru, urosaiwa une erangpai na wapai rarong pa. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Interi Yesusi meraru Yau asaru, na yanato umpika untamami Sebedeusi, na wa wadi rarong kong nyontarai we engkonti paya mae urua Yesusi.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi nyari panang pa we nyontarai we semi-semi yumaoi na Kapernaumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:32-37">Luk. 4:32-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesusi kong ne we etuari paya empapa na Kapernaumi na a Sabati Yaudi piana tawa pa, Yesusi yua na manu Yaudi esominai pai mae denyau.<verse eid="MRK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Nyontarai we entaraoi paya esarokutuya kia. Wo I denyau ya pa parari nyontarai we ne mambiri, warui kuru akama Yaudi paya etanyau pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mat. 7:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk. 4:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Na a yani na manu Yaudi esominai pai, nyontarai pei semi-semi yumaoi. I denana doyo, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Hei Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti pa Au, bong pitoi we amapae? Au bo mung amae? Yau ereuaroana we mateidi Aupa: We Momarang na Allai!” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Mana Yesusi deirorai doyo, “Aidinau, moti warui nyontarai nini!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Semi-semi pai piodidou nyontarai wadi na kangkuna, interi denana na rauwapui poya mae meti warui nyontarai wadi. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Nyontarai wauya engkai esarokutuya kia, impaina engkawio waweriao ya etoyo, “Pitoiandi sonini paie? Anyau waworu pina. I kewio na paya. I deirora semi-semi paya mae ya entuang wei.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Interi kawio parari Yesusi pa embuwua na mararu tate raora Galilea tantenang.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we empau Yesusi dosa empanang.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yesusi meti warui manu Yaudi esominai pai. Interi I ria kong Yakobusi kong Yoanesi wu Simoni kong Andariasi une manu pai. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Simoni neoni wawingpai wiata tutu yui deininuanang. Ya emararua entopana we Yesusi parari wawingpai we yuipa. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Impaina Yesusi riawu Simoni neonia, mae riu na warangpa, interi riupatari tewa. Ui deininuanang pa nyai warui mae i wesarawiri ya. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Wopai ria do sawa, engko nyontarai tau we esui kong semi-semi yumao ya peaya wu Yesusi ma. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Nyontarai tau we na bendari wadi embawawu ya na manu wadi ne aturarei repong pai. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Interi Yesusi nyari nyontarai empau we etadu ui totoi empanang kong dedawa semi-semi pitau. I rioa wa, we semi-semi paya we engkawio pa, wo endearoani paina.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi denyau na bendari pea weiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk. 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Kamaipai ayari dea wami, Yesusi tewa mae meti tori. I riato nu we mananopi mae tendau nayana. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Mana Simoni kong ne maniwowi paya enda we eserai Yesusi. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Na awe etaduti pa mamo engkawio etoyo, “Yaie! Nyontaraipa engkai eserai Au.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mendama tanda to nupa ea, to bendari pa we kikeu na raora nini, imbaro na wana Ewuwu Arera Weweng nei, tutu aidonama Erama nina.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Interi I riato raora Galilea tantenang, mae na yana I wiuwu Arera Weweng na manu Yaudi esominai pa. I tato dedawa semi-semi paya warui nyontarai semi-semi yumao ya pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat. 4:23</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luk. 4:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we nyontarai we yui pado pei.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk. 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Nyontarai we yui pado pei riama meoi aebu na Yesusi renawau mae i dewara doyo, “Yaie! Muaya mamo, bong yau epanang.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesusi anewiwu kia we nyontarai pai. Impaina I riuwa warampa mae warawawu nyontarai wadi mae kewio doyo, “Yo emaya we au ponang, impaina ponang to.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />A yanito ui pado pai nyai warui nyontarai yani, mae i penang. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Interi Yesusi demi nyontarai wadi ria mae yuari na kangkuna, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Doyo Anengkakepana remo kowiora we nyontarai pei parari pinina pe, mana ruawu imami paya, mae bonyawi nentarai pai we piana ponangto. Mae bong pikika pieung pa we Allai tutu ponang pa, pikika pieung yani parari we Musai kewiora pa, imbaro we pianyawa we nyontarai paya kuira we taraie piana ponangto.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Im. 14:1-32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Mana nyontarai wadi ria kewio kakera piyana mae wiuwua to nu totoi ea, impaina Yesusi ria denyawi rekami pa wa na nyontarai paya endenapa na bendari rarong pai. I nyai na raora we mananopi na bendari ri pa; mana nyontarai na nu pa totoi ea enda pampang wu Yesusi ma.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong nyontarai piaya pei penaang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ape bototoi ea na awe Yesusi teweri to bendari Kapernaumi pa, interi nyontarai paya entarao Yesusi we nyaina na manu wane. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Impaina nyontarai paya empau endama embawaweri ya impaina nu pa donungna kai, toyana aturarei na manu repong pai tato donung kuira. Interi Yesusi wiuwua parari Allai ne Arera pai weya. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Interi nyontarai embe manua endama engko nyontarai muang we piaya pei na kewang pei wu Yesusi ma. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mana engkori esua wa tutu nyontarai tau, impaina engkori embeita wu manu wawongpai. Interi esepa randaung pei, empiri na kewang we denanai pai, na nyontarai pitau enerabuang randana pa tate Yesusi renapa. <figure style="fig" file="LB00305C.TIF" size="col" ref="2:4">Esepa randaung pei, empiri nyontarai piaya pai tate Yesus renapa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Na awe Yesusi reo pi etonapa, I rearoana we ya endoao I. Impaina kewio we nyontarai piaya pai doyo, “Eh Neu kumai pa au, nemu sasari pa yupirandenia to!” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Mana nayana kuru akama Yaudi pa embetotoi emayoi nayana, ya esanetatuata na esanerarong etoyo: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Topitotoi nyontarai nini kewio toyana pa. Wo nyontarai pei ne mambiri pea wa we dupirandeni sasari pa, mantau Allai memeari ki. I kengkani Allai.” <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Mana na yanato Yesusi piana aneao esanetatuata pa, impaina kewio doyo, “Pitoidonane mesanetatuata toyana na mesanerarongpai pae? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Totoai mawa we etopana pa; ‘Yoyo, nemusasari pa piana yupirandenia to,’ ete yoyo ‘Towa, ruwa nemu kewang pai ruan to e’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Mana imbaro mesanekakepana we na nunei mamo Kumai Nyontarai nei ne paya we dupirandeni sasari.” Interi kewio we nyontarai we piaya wadi doyo, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Etopana we au, towa, ruwa kewang we buena naipai toweri to nemu manu pai!” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Nyontaraipai tewa meraru riuwa ne kewang we denanai pai ria tori na nyontarai paya endena pa, impaina ya esarokutuya interi etaparanding Allai, etoyo, “We tonina pa tandeoa na ea wami.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yau Lewi we duari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Piana pa Yesusi teweri ea to kareng ruru Galilea pai, nyontarai madu peaya enda wurima, interi I denyau ya. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Interi Yesusi ria rire kareng yani pai, na awe ria na nu yani pai, I reo nyontarai weyau wiwai pei meyoi na manu weyau wiwai nai pai, anong pei Lewi, Alpiusi ne kumai dina. Interi Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Ruama ruakong Yau!”. Impaina Lewi tewa interi riakong Yesusi.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Interi na awe Yesusi meyoi dampi rai na Lewi ne manu pai pa, nyontarai we esau wiwai pa madui kong nyontarai we etong sasari paya, etampi kuira kong Yesusi kong ne nyontarai etuari paya, wo madu pea yati etuari paina. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Na awe kuru akama Yaudi paya na pandura nyontarai embe Farisi paya, endeo Yesusi we meyoi dampi kuira kong nyontarai we esau wiwai paya kong nyontarai sasari paya na yana pa, engkawio we Yesusi ne nyontarai etuari paya etoyo, “Topitotoi mene Mantaunyau pai dampikong nyontarai weyau wiwai kong nyontarai embe sasari paya yana pa e?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesusi tarao ene kawiopa interi kewio weya doyo, “Nyontarai we esuiwa, eserai we doteri wa, mana nyontarai we esui paya; Erama nina era we eyau nyontarai we emai paya wa, mana we nyontarai embesasari paya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai Yaudi ene anang pa parari puasa pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Apeana awe Yoanis Pembaptisi ne nyontarai etuari paya kong nyontarai embe Farisi paya embepuasa, interi nyontarai peaya endama engkawio we Yesusi etoyo, “Topitotoie Yoanisi ne we etuari paya kong nyontarai embe Farisi paya embepuasa, mana nemu nyontarai etua Au paya wereria nina pae?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesusi rioa weya doyo, “Topino, muang we nyari ne munara didau pai, yau ne pandura paya to ne munara didau pai ma mamo, ne pandura paya embepuasa e? Wereria ya etampi rai! <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Mana ingkai a we rama wane, muang didau pai engkori warui ya, nayana mamo ingkai embepuasa ki.”<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />I sopang nari sosiau pei ea wu yara doyo, “Nyontarai pei pioabu irei awarung na asung waworu we dingkapioi na asung tawa nei wa, tutu na toyana pa irei awurungwe waworu nei pioabu asung we tawapai, interi ne we teabu pai ingkai beba raweina ea. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Topiyana tato, nyontarai pei yoni angguri waworu wu kaketa piaung rerawa we tewa wadi wa, wo toyana mamo angguri waworu wadi ingkai yai ma dona kaketa tawa wadi teabu, kong angguri wadi tewowu mae kaketa wadi tekakutu. Mana angguri waworu wadi andi esoni na kaketa waworu pei tato.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi ne nyontarai ura ea kodu paya engkutu potang pai na a Sabati pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Na a Sabati Yaudi pei Yesusi kong ne nyontarai etuari paya endakutu romi potang pei, kong na endakutu romi pai pa ne nyontarai paya etetang potang bongwau.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Ul. 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Nyontarai embe Farisi peaya endeo piwe toyana interi entopana we Yesusi etoyo, “Remoa! Pipatotoi nemu nyontarai etua Au paya enari pi uara we enari na a Sabati Yaudi pai pa e?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Interi Yesusi rioa weya doyo, “Mia wo piana metatora pitoai Dauti nyari pa, na awe i kong ne nyontarai paya embawi tutu ene roweang pea wa pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sam. 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Aino Dauti yua to Allai ne Yawa Mamarang pai na awe Abyatari riuwe Imami Baba pa, interi dewa roti pa we dang kong dona we ne wetuari paya etang pa. Mana naina Kawio we Musai soipai wo, imamipa yati etampa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Im. 24:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Interi Yesusi sopana we nyontarai embe Parisi paya doyo, “A Sabati nei mamo Allai nyari weuna we nyontarai paya kong Allai nyari nyontarai neya we a Sabati pai wa. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Impaina Kumai Nyontarai nei mamo we Seni we a Sabati Yaudi pai tato.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang pa we nyontarai we waradoei keda pei na a Sabati pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk. 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Na a Sabati Yaudi pei ea Yesusi yua taweri ea wu manu Yaudi esominai pai. Na yana nyontarai pei wara doei keda. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Nyontarai embe Parisi pa embetotoi endekakepang Yesusi na aidina, topino Yesusi nyari nyontarai yani penaang na a Sabati Yaudi pai mamo, etadu sarara we etimbu I. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesusi kewio we nyontarai we wara doei keda pai doyo, “Ruama boati na rabuang ne!” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Na kawio we Musai soi pa mamo, denyau tata we na a sabati Yaudi pai mamo tamamuna kong tamung nyontaraie?” Wereria wiria, mana denyau tata we tanari wemai pa kong tampariri nyontarai. Mana ya aidisa. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesusi anerarong papea tutu ene esuwirera pa, donane I keou. Impaina rewawariao nu we doanai pai kong kewio we nyontarai wadi doyo, “Tuwa waramupai ma!” Interi nyontaraipai suwa warang paia, impaina warangpai penaang. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Interi nyontarai embe Farisi wauya emati emararu engkawio maikong nyontarai we entabari we Herodesi, ya esanerarong koiri we emung Yesusi.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panangpa we nyontarai we empau paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Interi Yesusi kiong ne nyontarai etuari paya esaya wu ruru paia, kong nyontarai empau enda na raora Galilea etua Yesusi. Nyontarai empau tato endana raora Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />na bendari Yerusalemi, na raora Idumea, na raora maria Yordani domurang wanei kong na nu wekiria na bendari Tirusi kong Sidoni. Ya kuira endawu Yesusi ma, tutu ya entarao pitaubai we Yesusi dona pa paina. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yesusi demi ne nyontarai etuari paya emanyena wa pei demamang we I, wo nyontarai paya empau paina, imbaromi endeo engkepang Yesusi pe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mrk. 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk. 5:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Yesusi wo dong nyontarai madupei empanang, impaina nyontarai we etaiwau ui pa, etairora ya wu Yesusi ma, imbaromi ya embaratui I. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Anemai semi-semi paya endeo Yesusi pa, ya emayoi esaebu na Yesusi renapa kong etanana etoyo, “Au wo Allai Antung di Au.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Mana Yesusi yua ya kangkuna, we entopana we matei dina pa.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi diri nyontarai ura ea kodu we etuari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Interi Yesusi wieita to wi peia. I yau nyontarai we anewengsa paya kong ya endawuria. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Yesusi diri nyontarai pe ura ea kodu we embe rasuri etaruari pampang, we demi ya embuwu ne Arera Weweng pai, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />kong dong mambiri weya we etintandawa semi-semi paya. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Nyontarai ura ea kodu we diri ya paya mamo: Simoni, we Yesusi yau anompei Petrusi, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobusi kong neta Yoanisi, Sebedeusi ne kumai di asaru, asaru mamo Yesusi yau usanomi pei Boanergesi, ne wang pei kumai kaidu. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Kong Andareasi, Pilipusi, Bartoromeusi, Matiusi, Tomasi, Yakobusi Alpiusi ne kumai dina. Yesusi tato Yau Tadeusi, Simoni nyontarai we demuna we Israeli wau entori warui Roma wauya pai, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />kong Yudas Iskarioti we ingkai wio Yesusi pai.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kong Beelsebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat. 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk. 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Interi Yesusi teweri wu manu meoi nai pai ea. Nyontarai taubai paya enda ema empandura na yana, impaina Yesusi kong ne nyontarai etuari paya etadu a pea we etampi wa. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Awe Yesusi ne mandarong paya entarao piyana pa, ya endama eto engkori, wo etoyo Yesusi piana yewawi to.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Kuru akama Yaudi paya we endana Yerusalemi ma pa etoyo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beelsebuli mamo Nyombatang dina ete Nyombatang pai anong pea aina</char></note> “Semi-semi paya ene mananu pai, aino Beelsebuli yumao Yesusi. I dong paya pa we Yesusi, impaina Yesusi dedawa semi-semi paya yana.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk. 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Impaina Yesusi yau ya interi kewio weya na sosiau pa doyo, “Topitotoi Nyombatangpai dedawa ne semi-semi paya raie? Wereria. <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Topino negara pei ne rai paya embawaweri yara entebabau mamo, negara yani ingkai we muna-munai. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Tato we mandarong pai, topino ya embawaweri yara entababau mamo, mandarong yani ingkai we munamunai. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Toyana tato, we Nyombatang pai, topino i demuna kangkuna we mantau ne semi-semi paya kong i tebabau koiri-koiri, mamo i we munamunai to. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Nyontarai pei doyo yua we dewaa we piaya pei pinempa na ne manu pai mamo, i andi dawi nyontarai yani pampongwo. Interi yuara we dewa we piaya yani pai pinempa ki. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Yau etopana kangkuna we mia: Allai ingkai dupirandeni sasari taubai kong kangkania we nyontarai pa enari waweriao ya pa. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Mana parari nyontarai pei kengkani Duainunung Mamarang pai mamo, Allai dupirandenia wa. Mae Allai subakamana we dong sarara, tutu i piana dong sasario Allai dupirandeni na eawa ki woroi-woroi.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat. 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesusi kewio toyana wo ya engkawio etoyo Yesusi wo ene mananupai yumaoi paina.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mateidi Yesusi Yau ya we neta nempa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Na awe Yesusi denyau rai mamo nyani kong ne neta paya endama. Katene ya etoa na ri wane, mae ya etami nyontarai pei yau Yesusi. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Nyontarai we empau paya emayoi esoriwari Yesusi, ya engkawio we Yesusi etoyo, “Remua nyamui kong nemeta nemu paya, yati enai na ri wane, kong esamupa we etadu Au.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Matei di neu inani kong matei di neu neta paya pae?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Interi Yesusi reaoa we nyontarai we empau esoriwari paya, mae kewio doyo, “Nini pai mamo inani dina kong neu neta pe yana. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Matei dongparari Allai ne awia pa, iwo neta neu muang dina kong iwo neta neu wawing dina, iwo inani-dina.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari nyontarai we riayang pikami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-23">Mat. 13:1-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-15">Luk. 8:4-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Na a pei Yesusi ria ea denyau na kareng ruru Galilea pai. Na yana nyontarai tau endama esoriwari I, impaina wieita to wa we deweoi na yana pai meyoi nai mae denyau nyontarai tau paya. Mae nyontarai tau paya etoa na reipa, na ruru arawa pai entarao ne anyau pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk. 5:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kong I denyau pi pau na sosiau weya. Na Ne anyau pa kewio weya doyo: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mentarama! Nyontarai we nyari romi pei, ria ra riayang pikami pa. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Na awe riayang pikami pa, ea tawa na rang arawa pa, interi aya paya esapoma etang ra kai. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ea tato tawa na kakopa wekami, we ne kakopa pa pau wa, interi pikami pa kemamai sua meraru tutu kakopa pa meni paina. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Mana awe wopai piana wieita pa, pikamipai meninunung kong memaa tutu wewa wa. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ea tawa na nu we papea aisasinai rarong pa, interi papea aisasinai pai kemamaia beba kepang pikami paia keda, impaina webong wa. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Mana pikami pa eaya tawa na kakopa wemai, pikamipai kemamai na wengkia kong webong, ne bongpai piau raweina, ea piarei ea ura raweina, ea piatoru raweina, ea tato piaring raweina.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Interi Yesusi kewio doyo, “Topino mentarakambirei pea mamo mentaraoa aiwara!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitoai dona Yesusi kewio denyau na sosiau pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Na awe Yesusi memeari pa, ne nyontarai etuari wauya kong ne nyontarai ura ea kodu wauya etutani parari sosiau yani. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Rioa weya doyo, “We mia mamo Allai dong ne weweng pa we mesaneao pi anyuing parari Allai ne riu we Mananu pa. Mana we nyontarai endoaoa wa paya, pipatotoi Yenyau ya na sosiau pa. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Imbaro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Endeoa kia, mana endearoana wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">entaraoa kia, mana esaneoa wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">imbaro endeo entaweri we Allai pe kong I dupirandeni ya pe.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Yes. 6:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Interi I kewio weya doyo, “Mentapu sosiau nini pai wae? Toyana mamo topitotoi mentapu sosiau eaya kuira pa e? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mentarama. Nyontarai we riayang pikami pa mamo we wiuwu Allai Ne Arera pa. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Pikami we tawa na rang arawa pa mamo, perari nyontarai we entarao Allai Ne Arera pai, interi Nyombatangpai riama dewa kawio we katene entaraoa yana warui ya. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Toyana tato na pikami we tawa na kakopa wekamipa, perari nyontarai we entarao Allai Ne Arera pai mae na mararu etamamang we Arera pa na emararising, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />mana Allai Ne Arera pai wewoa na esanerarongpai wa kong naya katea ki. Na awe etadu didiwa pea tutu Allai ne kawiopa mamo, ya esutopui warui Seni. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Pikami ea tawa na papea aisasinai, perariapi nyontarai we entarao Allai Ne Arera pai, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />mana ya esaneriru we topitotoi embeng na nunei pa kong endewe etadu ra we pau kong piwe moyawa pa. Piyana pa kuira yua to esanerarongpa apui kekepang Allai Ne Arera pai impaina webong wa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Mae pikami we tawa na kakopa areri pai, parari nyontarai we entarao kawio pa kong endu na wemai Allai Ne Arera pai, ya emparari ai we kemamai webong, ne bongpai piau raweina, ea we piarei ea ura raweina, ea we piatoru raweina kong ea tato we piaring raweina.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari Padamara we engkawuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk. 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya ea doyo: “Nyontarai pei kiai ne padamara pei kewungwidori na babeu pei ete doni sura na pata pei wawa wa, mana doni yawa na rerawuani.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk. 11:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Wo pitau we anyuing pa ingkai ra taparera kong we mawa wa ingkai tantaraoa ra dea.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk. 12:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Topino mentarakambirei pea we mentaraoa mamo mentaraoa aiwara.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Toyana Yesusi kewio naria ea doyo, “Neu anyau we mentaraoa pa mendetatuata aiwara. Wo nyontarai we endetatuata na wemai ya ingkai entapu Neu anyau pa pau raweina ea. Mae nyontarai we emba Neu anyau paya, maidau we wata ko yapa ingkai Eko warui ya tato.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat. 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Luk. 6:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Nyontarai we dosaiwa anyau Yona weipa mamo ingkai Yona pau raweina ea wei. Mae nyontarai we dosaiwara wa we anyau dedutapa, mamo anyau katea we wata kontipa ingkai Eko warui.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk. 19:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari Allai riu we Mananu pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Interi Yesusi kewio doyo, “Allai ne riu we Mananu pa mamo tonina: Parari nyontarai we riayang pikami pa na kakopa pa, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />piana riayania kai pa, i teweri wu ne manu pai ea, mae diru raida pikami pai kemamai beba. Impaina topitotoi pikamipai kemamai kong beba pa i rearoani wa. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kakopa pai andi donia webongpa, retenang peino weraungpai, interi nebopupai, katea ea mamo ne bongpai. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mae ra kioo ne bongpai na awe engkutui pa, nyontarai pai riara kiutui tutu awe engkutui pai riama to.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Yl. 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari pikami we kirinti wiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-35">Mat. 13:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesusi kewio eaya doyo, “Na pitoi ea tatona we tatintatua Allai ne riu we Mananupa eampae? Impaina Yo etopang sosiau pei we mia ea. <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Allai Riu we Mananupa netarai parari sosiau nini. Pitantanang pei ne kami pai kirinti warui pi kami na pitantanang na nunei pa. Nyontarai pei kioria riayang na kakopapa, pikami yani esawi we pitantang sesawi dina. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Mana na awe piana kemamai pa, andi beba raweina warui raung ei pa kuira mae ne arirawani we baba. Impaina aya we esapo paya, esapo ma enari ene karaini na arirawani pa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Na sosiau pau toyana pa, Yesusi wiuwu Allai ne Arera pai we nyontarai paya. Yesusi denyau ya parari pitoai endekamana pa. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesusi denyau nyontarai taubai paya mamo denyau ya pampang na sosiau pa, mana denyau ne nyontarai etuari paya mamo I kewio bauara dea weya.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yua wanangpai kong tarowapai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Na a yani, awe rawandeng to, Yesusi kewio we ne nyontarai etuari paya doyo, “Mendama tantapira to ruru dowani.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Impaina Yesusi ne nyontarai etuari paya embeita to wa we Yesusi dewoi nai pai, interi ya etapai warui nyontarai empau paya. Wa eipa etapai konta. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Woroi wami interi dowarapai wia era mae tarowa yao wapai rarongpai, impaina wapai kikeu we dewira. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Na a yani Yesusi dena na wapai rarongpui pai, dukamipai wiata na aduana pei. Impaina ne weetuari paya embauni mae etoyo, “Kuruie, tangkada rai, mae anemutatuta we pianea wae?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Interi Yesusi doa, piayao dowara wadi mae kewio we ruru wadi doyo, “Aidina, modori to!” Interi wanang wadi kong ruru wadi medoria keda. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Impaina Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Totoai memataita pa? Totoai mendoaoa wa pa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Weetuari paya endeo piyana pa ematai kapara mae engkawio waweria weya etoyo, “Nyontarai neio mateina, impaina wanangnei kong tarowanei untuang wei pae?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi dedawa semi-semi pai warui nyontarai Gerasa pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Interi Yesusi kiong ne nyontarai ura ea kodu paya, esua na ruru dowani na raora nyontarai Gerasa paya. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Katene, Yesusi wia warui wapai, mamo nyontarai we semi-semi paya esumaoi pai, wiana aisata wane ma dedu Yesusi. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Nyontarai yani nyaina wana mae nyontarai pei piaya we dawiti wa, na wai besi ki, mana piokakutua, <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />tutu i wo etawiti pampang na wai besi pa, mana wai besi pa piokakutua, impaina nyontarai pei piaya we riu widori wa. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Raida diru dari na nu aisata wane kong na wipa mae ria denana, kong riora netaraipai na kami.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Na awe reao Yesusi na woroi pa, depaia dedu Yesusi, suang meoi aebu yomi we I. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7-8" />Yesusi kewio we semi-semi paya doyo, “Eh, semi-semi pa au, moti warui nyontarai nini.” Mana nyontarai semi-semi pai yumaoi pai yeau kangkuna doyo, “Yesuse, Allai Wetedai Raweina pai Antung pa Au! Nemu pianea kong yau wa! Na Allai Anongpa yoyo remo bongtati yau pe!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Interi Yesusi dutang wu nyontarai we semi-semi yumaoi pai doyo, “Anomu pe?” Nyontarai wadi rioa we Yesusi doyo, “Anoupei Legioni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Legioni mamo kawio Latini pina, ne arti pei pandura apai mamuna Roma pai na a yani, empau pa kikeu we piaura we ring we wonang (6,000)</char></note>, tutu amampau kia.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Impaina nyontarai we semi-semi yumaoi pai, dewara kangkuna we Yesusi imbaro dedawa semi-semi paya emati warui raora yani pe.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Na wana, na wi tararei wane tapui madupei eserai etampi na wana, <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />interi semi-semi paya etewara kangkuna we Yesusi etoyo, “Bomi ama amasua na tapui wanea!” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesusi rioa we piwe etewara pa. Interi semi-semi wauya ematia esua na tapui paya. Tapui paya empau piaura we ring we kodu, etapai esayadung na tararei pai wu ruru wadia engkada esarewa.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Nyontarai we etaiwai tapui wauya etapaiya entopana na bendari pa kong awa na yana pa. Interi nyontarai wauya emati ma endeo pitoai tawa toyana pa. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ya endawu Yesusia, endeo nyontarai we rawandeng pe semi-semi esumaoi pai piana penangto. I meoi kong piana yesuni to. Impaina nyontarai paya ematai. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Nyontarai we endeo piyana meari paya, engkawiora we nyontarai etapai ma paya, parari pitoi tawa pa na nyontarai semi-semi esumaoi pai kong piwe tawa na tapui paya pa. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Interi nyontarai tau na raora yani etewara kangkuna we Yesusi imbaro ria warui raora enembau.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Na awe Yesusi wieita naria meoi na wapai rarongpa, nyontarai katene semi-semi paya emati warui pai, dewara kangkuna imbaromi ria kong Yesusi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Mana Yesusi miaya wa, I kewio we nyontaraipai doyo, “Toweri wu manu nemu waneia, wu nyontarai na awa nemu pai kong topana weya, parari pitaubai we Seni nyari we au pa kong Anerarongpai weweng we aupa!”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Impaina nyontarai yani pai ria mae wiuwua na raora Dekapolisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapolisi, na kawio Yunani mamo anong we bendari ura tutu na yana dedu awa baba ura.</char></note>, pitaubai we Yesusi dona na netarai nempai, mae ya kuira esarokutuya.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong Yairusi ne kumai pai penang, kong dong panangpa we wawing we yui dawing riapai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Impaina Yesusi kong ne nyontarai etuari paya, etapai kutua na wapai to ruru dowani ea. Na ruru arawa pai, nyontarai madu peaya endama esoriwari Yesusi. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Interi nyontarai we wedung na manu Yaudi esominai pai, anompei Yairusi. Na awe reo Yesusi pa i diangkai aebu pa. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Kong dewara kangkuna wu Yesusi doyo, “Neu kumai wawing pai yui, waketo keda. Ruama bong waramupa wata na netaraipai, imbaromi penang kong keda wa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Interi Yesusi riakong nyontarai yani. Nyontarai paya empau etuari kong etairora ya kikeu I.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Na yanapa nyontarai wawing pei, piana pudape ura ea kodu yui dawing ria. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />I dedu didiwa pitau tutu pi nempa donara kai wu doteri paya we, imbaro etoni penaang. Mana penaang wa, wo ne uipai wemioya wa raweina ea. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Wawing yani piana tarao kawio parari Yesusi, impaina na nyontarai we empau paya, i kikeu Yesusi na wapui kong dekatui Yesusi asung pampang pai. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Wo anetatuata doyo, “Yepaia yekatui Ne Asung pampang pai ki, mamo epanaang.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />A yani paito ui riapai menaing, kong i retuwa netaraipai piana penaang warui uipai to. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Na a yani to Yesusi rearoana we mambiri pea mati warui netarai pai. Interi dedaiweri na nyontarai we empau paya kong dutang doyo, “Matei di riu Neu asung pampang nei pa e?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ne nyontarai etuari paya etoyo, “Kurui e! Mantau remoa topitotoi nyontarai nini ya etairora ya kikeu Au, kong Au butang we matei dekatui Au pa nina e?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Interi Yesusi rewaria we reo matei dong piyana pa. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Wawing yani pai metai kong didora, tutu aneao piwe tawa na netaraipai pa. Impaina ria ra suang meoi aebu pa na Yesusi renapa. Mae kewio parari pitoai nyari we Yesusi pa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Interi Yesusi kewio we wawingpai doyo, “Eh Neu kumai pa au, nemu roao Yau pa donama piana ponaang. Impaina ruana wemadoria. Kong nemu ui pai menaing warui au ea anto.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Na awe Yesusi kewio rai, nyontarai endama na Yairusi wewedung we manu Yaudi esominai pai ne manu pai ma kong etoyo, “Nemu kumai wawing pai piana keda to, remo woseung we ko Kurui eampe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Mana Yesusi meidai tarao kawio enempa pe, mae kewio we wewedung we manu Yaudi esomi nai pai doyo, “Remo motai pe, roaoa ki!” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Interi Yesusi rioa wa we nyontarai pei ria konti pe, mantau Petrusi, Yakobusi, kong Yoanisi, Yakobusi neta pai. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Na awe endara etadu wewedung na manu Yaudi esomi nai pai ne manupai pa, na wana Yesusi reo nyontarai endotu, esai kong etaidu na endaupui poya. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Interi Yesusi yua kewio we nyontarai wauya doyo, “Pitoi dona mia mendotupa kong mesai pae? Kumai nini kedawa, mana dena!” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mana ya emari Yesusi. Impaina Yesusi demi nyontarai paya enda tori warui manu pai. Interi kio kumai pai tamani kong nyani kong Ne nyontarai toru we itonda konti pai. Ya esua wu mandarong we etong kumai pai wianai pa. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Interi Yesusi riu kumai yani warang pa doyo, “Talita kum,” ne arti pei: “Neu kumai wawing pa au, Etopana we au, towa to!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Na yanapa to kumai pai tewa doa ria, wo ne puda pe piana ura ea kodu paina. Nyontarai we enai na yana paya esarokutuya kia. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Mana Yesusi derekamana kangkuna weya kia, imbaromi endeo embuwua piyana pa we nyontarai eaya pe. Interi I demi nyani kong tamani urong kumai pai dampi.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Entampi Yesusi na awa nempai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Interi Yesusi teweri kuira kong ne nyontarai etuari paya to mantau awa nempai. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Na a Sabati Yaudi pai, I denyau na manu Yaudi esominai pai. Jemaati tau esarokutuya na awe entarao Yesusi denyau pa, impaina engkawio etoyo, “Naina totoi nyontarai nini dedu pitaubai yana pae? Anekurayang topitotoi pei nyontarai nini pai deduta pae? Tandoao wa we I wo nyari pitantuma yana pa. <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Tutu tata wo tandearoani we I wo tukang ai dina, Maria ne kumai, kong Yakobusi, Yosesi, Yudasi kong Simoni eneta dina. Ne Rarowawing peati engkong tatane.” Interi ya entampiri. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Nyontarai nabi pei entuang wei na nupa totoi ea mana na awa mantau nempai, kong neta aririra paya kong ne mandarong paya entuang wei wa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoh. 4:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Na nu yani Yesusi dong pitantuma koiri wa, aino dong nyontarai pe embe totoi empanang na riuwa warangpa oya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6a" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6a" />I arokutuya tutu ya endoao wa.<verse eid="MRK 6:6a" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi denatu nyontarai ura ea kodu we etuari paya we kaikodu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6b" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6b" />Interi Yesusi riawaria na awa pei to awa pei ea mae denyau. <verse eid="MRK 6:6b" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />I yau Ne manarua ura ea kodu paya mae denatu ya we kaikodu we embuwu Allai ne Kawio pa. I dong paya weya we etintadawa semi-semi paya, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />kong I derera weya imbaro endeo engko pianea na endampa pe, aino aisoipai ki, mana rotipe, kaketape, pe na waietingkae esanerabuang pa tato wengki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk. 10:4-11</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mia mesaya mesaembangpa mae mendeo mengko asung we metindiwang mia pea pe. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />I tato kewio doyo, “Topino na nupei nyontarai pei demamang mia na ne manupai mamo, menai nayana ki mempika nu yani. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mae topino menda sisu nu pei ea, kong topino nyontarai nayana emaidai etamamang mia kong emaidai entarao mia mamo, mempika nu yani. Mae mentatai wawu na mesaemi pa we uara weya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat. 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Kis. 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Interi manarua ura ea kodu paya, enda embuwua we nyontarai paya we andi esanetaweri warui ene sasari pa. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Kong ya etadawa semi-semi we empau, kong esepu maning na nyontarai we esui we empau mae etong ya empanang<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak. 5:14</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herodesi demi pimamuna pei sekutu Yoanis Pembaptisi raukanang pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mananu Herodesi tato taraoa parari Yesusi, wo anong pa piana tapira kong nyontarai engkawiora etoyo, “Yoanis Pembaptisi piana tewa na nyontarai engkada paya to, kong aidonane I ne paya we dong pitantuma pa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Mana nyontarai peaya entopana etoyo, “Iwo Eliai na.” Eaya tato entopana etoyo, “I wo nabi pei parari nabi paya na a pampompa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat. 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mrk. 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk. 9:19</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Na awe Herodesi tarao piyana pa i kewio doyo, “Wereria, iwo Yoanis Pembaptisi we piana etekutu raukanangpai, mae andi tewa eampa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Wo tarai Herodesi demi nyontarai entapu Yoanesi mae etoni yua to wangkapai, tutu kio neta Pilipusi ne wawini Herodiasi we riauti pa. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Tutu Yoanisi piana yua Herodesi pampang doyo, “Remo ko nemetapai ne wawini we ruauti pe, yana mamo nari pisarara pa we Kawio Musai soi pa!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mat. 14:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk. 3:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Tutu yana pa donane Herodiasi anekayou Yoanisi mae anetatuata we do miuni mana deduta wa. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Wo Herodesi menduani we rearoan Yoanisi wo nyontarai mei kong memarang dina. Impaina demi ne pimamuna paya etawu Yoanisi na wemai na wangka rarong pai. Na awe Yoanisi kewio mamo Herodesi anerarong pai wemadori wa, toyana ki mana anewe tarao Yoanisi ne kawio pa.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Toyana ki mana Herodiasi tato dedu a we miung Yoanisi, na awe Herodesi dong munara we ne a nyani dawini pai. Na a yani i nyari munara baba we ne we endu anong tadai na ne wemananupa, we perwira baba paya kong we weempampong na rai Galilea paya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Na a yani Herodiasi ne kumai wawing pai riama kong meai. Ne meai pa wiaua Herodesi kong nyontarai we empanduya paya esanerarong pa. Mananu wadi kewio we karawing wadi doyo, “Pitoai anembea pa buewara ki. Yau ingkai yona we au!” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Interi Herodesi pepora wei doyo, “Pipatotoi ea we buewara pa ingkai yona we au, aino neu eruwe mananu ne wopea!” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kumai wadi ria dutang nyani doyo, “Pitoai ingkai yewari pa e?” Nyani kewio doyo, “Yoanis Pembaptisi dukamipai!” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Interi kumai wadi teweri merarua wu mananu Herodesi mae kewio doyo, “Yau yewarapi, na nina tato Yoanis Pembaptisi dukamipai na parawai pei!” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mananu Herodesi tarao kawio pa anerarong pai yai kia, mana tutu piana i pepora to na nyontarai we endawurima pa endenapa impaina i sampi piwe kumai wawing pai dewara pa wa. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Interi Mananu wadi demi nyontarai maninuing pei we imbaro kio Yoanisi dukamipai ma. Nyontarai yani ria sekutu Yoanisi raukanangpai na wangka rarong pai. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />I kio dukamipai na parawai pei mae doni wu karawing wadi mae karawing wadi doni we nyania. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Na awe Yoanisi ne we etuari paya entarao piyana pa, ya endama we engko Yoanisi netarai kakopa wadi, interi etatari.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong nyontarai embe piaura wering we ring (5,000) etampi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yoh. 6:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Interi rasuri we rawandempe Yesusi denatu ya pa, ya entawerima empandura kong Yesusi mae entopana Wei pitau we piana enari kong etanyaua pa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Tutu nyontarai tau peati endama kong eaya tato entaweri, impaina etadu a pea we etampi wa. Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mendama tandato nu we mananopi imbaro tamameari na wana mae tambaua tata katea.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Impaina ya esana wapai we etanyuing enetarai pai to nu we mananopi. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mana na awe ya eto etapai pa, nyontarai we empau paya endeo ya kong piana esanetatua etapaitoa pa to. Impaina nyontarai we empau paya na bendari na nu yani pai, ya enda emararu na rang reipai, empampong na etamang na nu we Yesusi etapai wea pa. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Na awe Yesusi wia warui wapai torei pa, I reo nyontarai we empau paya. I anewiwuo ya, wo ya emparari domba we engkiari mantaiwai. Interi I denyau anyau madupei weya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Bil. 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Raj. 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2Taw. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Yeh. 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Za. 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat. 9:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Piana wopai ria domemang we diru, ne nyontarai etuari wauya endawurima engkawio etoyo, “Nu nini menanopi kong piana do diruto. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Bomi ya entaweri imbaro ya embori roweang pea weya na awa we kikeu na nina pa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Mana Yesusi doyo, “Miati metongsa etampi pa!” Yesusi ne manarua ura ea kodu wauya etoyo, “Topitotoi andi amandara amambori roti ne arga pe peraki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pe peraki koiri mamo, mai parari nyontarai pei ne wiwai we riupi na a pei. Impaina pe peraki piaura (200) mamo, mai parari nyontarai pei ne wiwai na mariwa riu pa yembai pe boitu a kikeu we bo endeatoru.</char></note> piaura rai e? Wereria wiria.” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Interi Yesusi dutang weya doyo, “Roti pa bototoi ai menempa e? Mia mendeoa wo!” Ya endeoa, impaina etoyo, “Roti pe boring kong diang pe kodu.”<figure style="fig" file="cn01716B.tif" size="col" ref="6:38">Engko roti pe boring kong diang pe kodu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Interi I demi nyontarai paya engkai emayoi takakutui na naningpung pa wawong. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Toyana ya emayoi takakutui pa eaya piaring, kong eaya piakodua ura. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Interi Yesusi piana kio roti boring pa kong diang kodu pa, I reo to rora peidi dewa piboki, interi piobabau roti pa mae dona we ne nyontarai etuari paya, imbaro embiwo we nyontarai paya toyana tato na diang pa, ya embiwo we nyontarai we empau paya engkai. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Interi nyontarai paya kuira ya etang ki emoi. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Toyana nyontarai pa endurikui wopape we tantenang pa dedu bayai pe ura ea kodu donung. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Nyontarai muang we etang roti pa embe piaura wering we ring (5,000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi riana ai wawong pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yoh. 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Yana rakaipa Yesusi meraru deirora ne manarua paya, embeita to wapai mae etapai pampong to ruru dowani, to bendari Betsaida, mae I demi nyontarai we empau paya entaweri. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Piana Yesusi pika nyontarai paya, I ria to wi peia we tendau nayana.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Na awe piana diru to, ne nyontarai ura ea kodu wauya etapaia sisu ruru rabuang paito, mana Yesusi nyai meari na rei pa rai. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Awe I reo ya we esaseung we embo wa wadi tutu esoa wanang yopai, a yani piana diru rabuang wake saraka riora botoru wu bowonang ayari pa. I ria na ai wawong pai wu yara mae I dongparari ingkai ria raweing ya. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Awe ya endeoi ria na ai wawong pa, ya etorato I wo wori dina, interi ya etanana pampang, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />wo ya engkai endeo I mae ya esarokutuya kia. Mana I meraru kewio weya doyo, “Aidimia! Yau nina, mendeo mematai pe!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Interi I wieita na wa wadi wu yara eai mae wanangpai medori. Ya esarokutuya kia tutu piwe tantuma yana. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Wo piwe tawa na roti pa mamo ya esaneatori wami, mae ya esanerarong pa kabung.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we nyontarai we esui na raora Genesareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat. 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Na awe empapa na ruru dowani, ya etawoi na kareng Genesareti. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Katene emati warui wapai pa, na mararu nyontarai pa endearoni we Yesusi riama yani. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Impaina nyontarai paya etapai tate nupa kai, mae engko nyontarai we esui paya na andaung wawong pa wu Yesusi, to nu totoi we entarao I nyaina pa: <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />To nu totoi ea I ria oapa, na bendaripa ete awa pa. Nyontarai pa empika we esui paya wu nu awayang pa mae etewara we Yesusi imbaro etakatui Ne asung pampang pai ki. Kong nyontarai tau we etakatui Yesusi ne asung pampang pa empanang.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Allai ne airorapa kong Yaudi pa ene anangpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Mat. 15:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Apeana nyontarai we embe Farisi embetotoi kong kuru akama Yaudi paya embetotoi, enda na Yerusalemi wu Yesusi ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Endeo Yesusi ne nyontarai etuari paya embetotoi etampi na endoi embaramipa wa. Ya etong parari Yaudipa ene anangpai wa. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Wo nyontarai embe Farisi paya emparari nyontarai Yaudi peaya we etampi wa aino endoi embaramipa wa, tutu endukepang kanang na entapumi paya pa. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kong entaweri na pasaripai mamo etampi wa mana endoipapi ene taraipa pampong wo. Kanang madupe ai endu pa, parari endoi nyopi, babeu kong piawawa ea we enari na tembaga pa. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Nyontarai embe Farisi kong kuru akama Yaudi paya, ya endukepang kanang na entapumipa na wemai. Ai donama etutang Yesusi etoyo, “Pitoai donama nemu nyontarai etua Au paya embeng parari kanang tantapumi woriai paya wa, mana etampi na embarami pa kararia nina pae?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesusi rioa weya doyo, “Pitoai na pampompa Allai kewiora na Ne weraung mamarang pai na nabi Yesayai parari mia nyontarai metong sambamboni pa, piana tawa to, aino soi doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Kawasa nini esomi we Yau na esoremi arawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">tutu esanerarongpa woroi warui Yau.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Yes. 29:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ya wo esomi we Yau na weuna wa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">wo anyau we etanyauwa pa mamo airora na nyontarai pina.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesayai 9:13</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Yesusi kewio pampang doyo, “Allai Ne kawiopa metongpararia wa, mana metong parari kanang na nyontarai paya.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Interi I kewio naria ea weya doyo, “Tarai memanuainung kia we mentampi Allai ne airora pai, imbaro metarara kanang mantau menempai pa. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Tutu Musai piana sopana doyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:10">‘Tuang we tamamui kong nyamui,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 7:10">mae</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:10">matei di piora tamani kong nyani mamo ingkai keda.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kel. 20:12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Im. 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Ul. 5:16</ref> </char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Mana mia metanyau metoyo, ‘Pianea wa, we topino topana we tamamui kong nyamui asaru boyo, piwe yona we yimpata marupa piana yona we Allai eampa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Pitoai mia metaunyauwa toyana pa piana dong nyontarai yani anewaweri we tamani kong nyani asaru wa. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Na anyau metanyauwa toyana pa denyawa we Allai ne Arera pai mempikara we metongparari mene kanangpa. Kong pi pau toyana pa mia metong pararia tato.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Impaina Yesusi yau nari nyontarai we empau paya, interi kewio doyo, “Mia mengkai mentara mamoo Yau, kong mesanekakepana na wemai. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Pipatotoai na ripa, yua na nyontarai pei apui pa, kio kararia wa, mana ne metitori na nyontaraipai, yanaino kio kararia pa.” [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Mate au wetarakambirei pea we taramoa mamo, andi taramoa aiwara!]<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Interi ria yua na manupei we pikari warui nyontarai empau paya, na yana ne nyontarai etuari paya etutani parari sosiau we katene I sopani yana. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Impaina rioa weya doyo, “Mia tato mesanetatuata wae? Menduinaria wa we piwe na ri pa yuato nyontarai pei mamo dong kararia wae? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Tutu we yua pa, yua wu tasanerarong pai wa mana wu tasanemipai, interi tampikara na neainipai.” Na toyana pa I kewio kangkuna we roweampa kuira we tapua wa na Allai renapa. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Kewio naria ea doyo, “Pitoai meti tori na nyontarai pei anerarongpai, yana paino dong nyontaraipai kerariapa, <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />wo na rarong, na nyontarai anerarong pai anetatua pimamuna pa kia ai donapa; memota, menanapi, miung nyontarai, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />dena kong nyontarai ene muang ete wawini, rekami baba we nepi, nyari pi mamuna pa, weangkari barui, nyari pi meniniawari pa, anerarong yui we nyontarai, kengkani nyontarai, anerarong tedai kong dungkamipai meitui. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Pimamuna pitau nina paino meti na anemurarong kong kio kararia we nyontarai neya pa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wawing Siro-Fenisia we rioaoa Seni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat. 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Interi Yesusi ria warui nu yani mae ria to raora kikeu we bendari Tirusi. I yua to manu pei kong aneoa wa we nyontarai pei reaoi pe, mana ne riama pa anyuing wa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Nyontarai wawing pei ne kumai wawing pai semi-semi yumaoi. Na mararu tarao parari Yesusi we riama pa, interi ria meoi aebu pa na Yesusi renapa. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Wawing wadi mamo nyontarai Yunani dina na kawasa Siro-Fenisia. I dewara kangkuna we Yesusi we dedawa semi-semi pai warui ne kumai wawing pai. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Interi Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Au wo nyontarai Yaudi di au wa, impaina topino epata au mamo, mai parari nyontarai we andi dong roweang we ne kumai paya, mana roweang yana ne kumai paya etampia emoi wami, mae roweangpa yoa wu wona wadi.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mana wawingpai kewio doyo, “Senie, tarai. Mana wona we na meja wawa pai etang keang we kumai paya etona tawa na mejapai aweu pa.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Impaina Yesusi kewio we wawingpai doyo, “Toweria, tutu kawio topana pa denyawa we roaoa tarai, impaina semi-semi pai meti warui nemu kumai pai eampa.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Wawingpai teweri to ne manupaia, interi deduta we ne kumai pai wiata na aidisa na ne andaung pai, mae semi-semi pai piana metiwaruia.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus nyari nyontarai tarakambirei paro kong woremamong penang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Interi Yesusi ria warui raora bendari Tirusi ea mae ria pampangna ria rire raora bendari Sidoni to ruru Galilea pai, ria na rabuang raora Dekapolisi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Na yana nyontarai pea engko nyontarai we tara-paro kong woremamongpei wu Yesusia kong etewara we I, imbaro riuwa warangpa na nyontarai yani. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Mae piana Yesusi kiori warui nyontarai empau paya, impaina umameari. I suwa warakeapai to tarakambirei pai, interi kenyuo mantau warakeapai mae suwari wu nyontaraipai worepang paia. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Interi Yesusi reo to rorapai pioa asengpa mae sopana doyo, “Efata!” na kawio enempa, mamo, “Teparera.” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Impaina na a yani to nyontaraipai tarakambirei kodu pa teparera we tarana, mae na yana tato ui riuwido worempai penang mae kewio na wemai. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesusi derekamana we nyontarai we enai nayana pa imbaro endeo engkawiora we nyontaraipei pe. Yesusi yua ya toyana pampang ki, mana kawasa paya embuwua pampang we nyontarai eaya paya. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ya esarokutuya kia kong etoyo, “I nyari pitaubai pa wengkia, we entarakambireipa paro pa entaraoa, we esoretamung pa engkawio.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong nyontarai pe embe piaura we ring we manua (4,000) etampi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat. 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Na ayani nyontarai we empau kia endama empandura na yana. Ya ene roweang pea wa, impaina Yesusi yau ne manarua paya ma mae kewio doyo, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Aneurarongnei aneuwea tutu anewiwuo nyontarai we empau nea. Wo piana ape botoru to ya etua Yau kong ya ene roweang pea wa. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Kong topino Yemi ya entaweri to ene manu wane na embawi mamo, ya ingkai entabari na rang rabuang wanei, wo ea yati enda na raora we woroi wane ma paina.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ne manarua paya engkawio etoyo, “Topino raora nini pai menanopi paina, na totoi amatadu roti pe pau kia we nyontarai nea etang ki emoi pa?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesusi dutang weya doyo, “Mia mene roti pe bototoi?” Ya etoyo, “Boitu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Interi I demi nyontarai we empau paya emayoi na kakopa pai. Na yana I kio roti boitu pa, dewa piboki oa, piobabaua mae dona we Ne manarua paya we ya embiwoa we nyontarai we empau paya, interi ya etong pararia. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ya tato ene diang maia pea, kong piana I dewa piboki oa, interi demi ya embiwoa ea. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Interi nyontarai empau paya etampia emoi. Interi endurikui roti wopape tantenang pa ea, paupa bayai pe boitu. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Nyontarai paya wake piaura we ring we manua. Interi Yesusi demi ya enda. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />I meraru wieita to wa wadi kong Ne manarua paya mae entampira to raora Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai embe Parisi etewa kamang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat. 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Interi nyontarai embe Farisi pe embetotoi enda wu Yesusi ma, ya embawari kong Yesusi. We entou I paina, ya etewa kamang pei kong Yesusi kamang we rana Allai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38-39">Mat. 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk. 11:16</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:29">29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Impaina Yesusi anerarong dutani tutu kawio entopana pa, interi kewio doyo, “Pitoiandi nyontarai na pui nina ya etewara we enari kamang pae? Yau etopana we mia, tarai we nyontarai nisa topitotoi kia, Yau enari kamang pei wa.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Yesusi pika ya, interi I wieita wu wapai mae entampira to ruru dowani.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parari ragi nyontarai embe Parisi kong ragi Herodesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat. 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Yesusi ne manarua paya emparandeng engko rotipa, mae koiri ki andi engkori na wa rarong pai pa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Interi Yesusi yua ya kewio doyo, “Metamamang kong aidimia kong we ragi nyontarai embe Farisi kong ragi Herodesi aino etong ene unawa pa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk. 12:1</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Interi Yesusi ne manarua paya engkawio waweriao ya etoyo, “I kewio toyana, tutu tatawo tane roti pea wa.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Na awe Yesusi aneaoa pitoiai engkawiorapa, I kewio doyo, “Pitoi mia metoyo mengkiari roti peawa pae? Mia tato mesanetatuata kong mesanekakepana wa e? Mesanerarong pa maitui kia, impaina mesanetatua piwe katene tawa pa wa e? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mia mendekami we mendeoa to, mana pipatotoi mendeoa wa pae? Kong membetarakambirei we mentaraoa, topitotoi mentarao wa e? Piana memparandenia pe,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Yer. 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Yeh. 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mrk. 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />awe piobabau roti pe boring we nyontarai pe piaura wering we ring etang pa, roti wopapepa tantenang pa dedu bayai bototoi pa e?” Ya engkawio etoyo, “Bayai pe ura eya kodu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Kong awe roti pe boitu we nyontarai pe empiaura wering we manua pa, mendurikui wopape we tantenang pa dedu bayai bototoi pa e? Ya etoyo, “Bayai boitu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Impaina mia mesaneaoa wami e?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we nyontarai rekabe na Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Na awe Yesusi kong ne manarua paya etapaia sisu na Betsaida pa. Na yana nyontarai pa embetotoi engko nyontarai rekabe pei wu Yesusi ma, ya etewara wei imbaro I warawawu nyontarai rekabe wadi. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Interi Yesusi riu na nyontarai rekabe wadi warang wau mae kiori tori warui awa yani. Interi I kenyuo nyontarai wadi rekami wau kong warawawuri mae dutani doyo, “Piana au remo pianea tone?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Interi nyontarai wadi retopong mae kewio doyo, “Yau erewo nyontarai paya etoa enda mana erewo ya emparari ai.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Interi Yesusi warawawu nyontarai wadi rekami pa ea, impaina nyontarai pai reoa tarai kong piana penang. Toyana i reo pipatotoi ea na dea. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Interi Yesusi demi nyontarai wadi teweri to ne manu paia mae kewio doyo, “Remo wua to bendari pai pe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi rioa we Yesusi wo Mananu Mampariri dina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat. 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Interi Yesusi kong ne nyontarai etuari paya endato awa we nai na raora kiria we Kaisarea Pilipi. Na rang rabuangpa I dutang we ne nyontarai etuari paya doyo, “Nyontarai pa entopana etoyo mateidi Yau pae?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ya endoa etoyo, “Eaya entopana etoyo, Yoanis Pembaptisi, eaya tato entopana etoyo, nabi Eliai, eaya tato entopana etoyo, nyontarai pei na nabi na pampong paya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mrk. 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk. 9:7-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesusi dutang weya ea doyo, “Na mia mamo matei di Yau pae?” Interi Petrusi rioa doyo, “Au wo Mananu Mampariri di Au.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yoh. 6:68-69</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Interi Yesusi yua ya na kangkuna imbaro endeo embuwua we ei ea parari I pe.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi retenang kewio parari ne kaidapa kong parari topitotoi nyontarai etuari pa pitoi etaduta pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat. 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Interi Yesusi denyau ne manarua paya doyo, “Kumai Nyontarai nei andi yedo uira tau ki. Mananu Yaudi paya, we embedung we imami paya, kong kuru akama Yaudi paya ingkai entampiri, kong emuni mae piana ape botoru ea mamo I tewa naria ea.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesusi kewio piyana pa na anyuing wa we ne manarua paya. Mana Petrusi pio Yesusi topui, mae yuari. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Impaina Yesusi dedaiweri yeo ne nyontarai etuari paya mae I yua Petrusi kewio doyo, “Nyombatang pa au rua warui reunane, wo au anemuao piwe Allai anetatuata pa wa, mana au anemutatua parari we nyontarai esanetatuata pa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Interi Yesusi yau nyontarai we empau paya kong ne manarua paya mae kewio weya doyo, “Nyontarai pa matei do dua Yau mamo andi pika pitau nempa, kong yedo ne aitabapai mae dua Yau.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk. 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Tutu nyontarai pa matei do derara duainunung pai, i ingkai duainunung pai nyai; mae nyontarai pa matei na nunei nini anewiwu Yau kong Neu Arera Weweng nei donane duainunung pai nyai warui, i ingkai dedu wieng ki woroi-woroi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Moyawa we nyontarai pei yerai dedu nunei tantenang mana i duainunung pai nyai. <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Tutu pitoandi ingkai dona we dindiwang duainunung pai pae? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Wo nyontarai pa mateidi memaya rioa tutu Neu anyau ne kong Neu kawione na nyontarai etong sasari kong nyontarai pui nina we enukepana wanea wa enemadukuira nina mamo, Kumai Nyontarai nei tato ingkai memayao nyontarai yani na awe I ria taweri na Tamani ne wedea raweina pa rarong, kong mampang we emamarang pa etaruari pa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesusi kewio naria ea weya doyo, “Yau etopana we mia, taraie na nyontarai we endama nea nina, ea engkada wa ki endeo Allai ne riu we Mananu pa ria na mambiri ma pa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi ne tarai dea ra wieria na wi pei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat. 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ape bowonang we dapira pa, Yesusi kio Petrusi, Yakobusi kong Yoanisi mae kiong ya I wieita to wi we tedai pei. Nayana mantau ya emeari ki. Interi Yesusi rekamipa ra weia ea na endenapa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2Ptr. 1:17-18</ref></char></note><figure style="fig" file="LB00317C.TIF" size="col" ref="9:2">Yesusi dea weria na wi pai</figure> <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />mae Ne asungpa buara wieria. Nyontaraipei wa na nunei we pia asung pa, ei pia asungpa ra biua peraria wa. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Interi na tantuma Nabi Eliai kong Nabi Musai untapira ma uroa ungkawio kong Yesusi. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petrusi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Kuruie, wengkia we tanaina raora nini pai. Ama ingkai amanari yawa pe toru, koiri we Au, koiri we Musai kong koiri we Eliai.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />I kewio toyana pa, wo riuinari pitoai sopana pa, tutu ya ematai kia. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Interi mandipi pei wiama kewungwido ya mae na mandipi rarong pai nyondaupui pei kewio doyo, “Neu Kumai we aneuweni pina, mentarao I.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrk. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk. 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Na tantuma, awe endewawariao raora yani pai, ya endeo nyontarai pei wa, wo mantau Yesusi meari.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Na awe embia warui wi pai, Yesusi derekamana we ya, imbaro endeo embuwua we nyontarai pei pe we piwe endeoa pa, kioo Kumai Nyontarai pai tewa na nyontarai we engkada paya ene madukuira pa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ya endu arera wadi mae etutang waweriao ya pipatotoandi daoi tonini doyo, “Kumai Nyontarai nei ingkai tewa na nyontarai we engkada paya enemadu pa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Interi ya etutang we I etoyo, “Pitoandi kuru akama Yaudi paya entopana we Eliai andi ria pampong mawo?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal. 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat. 11:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesusi sopana weya doyo, “Tarai Eliai ingkai ria pampongma kong dong pitau nea manyena we Mananu Mampariri ingkai riama pa. Mana topitotoi na Arera Mamarang pai soikamana we Kumai Nyontarai nei, I ingkai dedu didiwa pitaubai kong ingkai nyontarai entatipari pa e? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Mana Yau ekawio we mia: tarai Eliai piana riama to mana nyontarai etongpampinomi na weuna wa parari we mantau esaneaoapa. Piyana parari pitoi entoi na Weraung Mamarang pai parari i pa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we kumai we dedu semi-semi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat. 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Na awe Yesusi, Petrusi, Yakobusi kong Yoanisi entaweri wu Ne manarua ea wauya pa, ya endeo nyontarai we empau esoriwari Ne manarua ea wauya pa. Mae kuru akama Yaudi embetotoi embawari pianea kong ya. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Na awe nyontarai we empau endeo Yesusi pa, ya esarokutuya kong ya engkai etapaia etamang Yesusi. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Interi Yesusi dutang ne manarua ea paya doyo, “Pipatotoandi membawari kong ya wei pae?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Nyontarai pei na we empau paya kewio doyo, “Kuruie, neu kumai nei engkori wu Auma, tutu semi-semi dauwi ki woretamung. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Kong anemai, na awe semi-semi pai yumaoi pa, i keyai to kakopa wawong wadi, mae wore kowowuai kong keridereng, netarai tepapari. Yau piana yewara we nemu nyontarai etua Au paya, imbaro ya etadawa semi-semi pai mana ya etaduta wa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Eh, nyontarai pui we mendoaoa wami pa ni mia, ape bototoi ea Yau andi yemamang mia we mendoaoa pae? Mengko kumai pai ma!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Interi engko kumai wadi wurima. Awe semi-semi pai reo Yesusi pa, pyodidou kumai wadia netarai pai tepapari, kong kumai wadi wiata keidui na kakopa wadi, woreng pa wekowowuai. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Interi Yesusi dutang we kumai wadi tamani doyo, “Piana ape bototoi woroi dedu piwe tonina pae?” Tamani kewio doyo, “Piana na kumai nei meia pa. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kong ea mamo semi-semi piapari to adia wadi rarong ete wu maria wadi rarong we miuni. Mana topino Yai Au boduta we puata mamo, anemuwiwu we ama kong puata ama.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesusi yuari doyo, “Topitotoi Au topana boyo: Topino Au boduta e? We nyontarai endoaoa paya mamo pitaubai pa, mawa kia!” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Nayana to kumai wadi tamani denana doyo, “Yau eroaoa. Puata yau, nyontarai we eroaoa wa nea yau!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Awe Yesusi reo nyontarai we empau enda pampang ma we empandura pa, I yua semi-semi pai na paya doyo, “Eh semi-semi we bona mamo kumainei woretamung kong pero pa au, Yau yeirora au moti warui kumai nini kong remo wua taweri eampe!” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Interi semi-semi pai meti kong denana mae pyodidou kumai wadi na kangkuna. Kumai wadi riaperari nyontarai we keda, impaina nyontarai we empau paya engkawio etoyo, “Kumaipai piana keda to.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Mana Yesusi riu na kumai wadi warang wau mae biauni interi kumai wadi mantau tewa.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Na awe Yesusi piana yuana manu wadi, mae ne manarua paya mantau engkonti. Ya etutani etoyo, “Pitoi donama amatadawa semi-semi nei wa pae?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Pi tonina pa mamo mantau metadawa na mentandau nei ki.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio nariaea parari ne kaida wau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesusi kong ne manarua paya enda warui nu yani mae enda rirera na raora Galilea, kong Yesusi meidai nyontarai pea endearoang piyana pe, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />wo I denyau ne manarua paya paina. I kewio weya doyo, “Kumai Nyontarai ingkai entampiri we nyontarai embararong pa, mae ya emuni, mae piana ape botoru eampa, I tewa warui kaidapa pai.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ya esaneao kawio yana wa, mana ya ene barui pea wa we etutani.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matei beba raweina pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Interi Yesusi kong ne manarua paya enda sisu na Kapernaumi. Na awe enda sisu na manupai, I dutang we ne manarua paya doyo, “Pitoai katene mengkawiora na rang rabuang pae?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Mana ya aidisa, wo na rang rabuang pa embawaweri ya we matei di beba raweina naya pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk. 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Interi Yesusi meoi mae yau ne manarua ura ea kodu paya, kewio weya doyo, “Topino nyontarai pei anewe do weretenang mamo, andi piria nyamui warui ya engkai mae i wesarawiri nyontarai paya kuira.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26-27">Mat. 20:26-27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43-44">Mrk. 10:43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk. 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Impaina Yesusi kio nyontarai kumai pei mae doni meoi na enemadukuira pa, interi I tepu kumai wadi mae kewio weya doyo, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Matei yewawa kumai pei parari ninane na anou Ne, i yewawa Yau. Mae matei yewawa Yau mamo, i yewawa Yau meari wa, mana i kong yewawa we demi Yau pai tato.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh. 13:20</ref> </char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai dua Yesusi wa dedawa semi-semi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk. 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yoanisi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Kuruie! Ama wo amandeo nyontarai pei we dua tata wa dedawa semi-semi pai na Anomu pa, interi amasua nyontarai wadi, tutu i dua tata wa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mendeo mesuari pe! Wo nyontarai pei wa, we piana nyari pitantuma na Anoune, na mararu i kengkani Yau wa. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Nyontarai pei doamuna we tata wa, mamo i tebari we tata.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat. 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk. 11:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Tarai, Yau ekawio we mia we nyontarai pa matei dong maria nyopi koiri we metunumi tutu mia wo metua mananu Mampariri pai paina, i ingkai dedu ne wiwai pa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat. 10:42</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piwe donane nyontarai etong sasari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat. 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Nyontarai pa mateidi donama kumai endoao Yau paya ei dong sasari mamo, weng wei peino engkae kami pai na raukanangpai mae engkai to rawanang pai. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Parari waramupai dong sasari mamo, tuekutui, tutu wengpei wua to wieng kio woroi-woroi pa na waramu kawuru, yana pa mai raweingna warui waramu kodu mae eso au to rawanang adia pai, to adia rarong we meo na ea wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat. 5:30</ref></char></note> [<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Na raora yani pai awi pa engkada wa, kong adia pai meo wa.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Topino aemupai dau au bong sasari mamo, tuekutui, tutu weng peino wuato wieng ki woroi-woroi pa na wokikoi, weng warui aemupa kodu mana eso au to rawanang adia rarong pai pa; [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />na raora yani awi pa engkada wa, kong adia pai meo wa.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Toyana rengkamipa dau au we bong sasari mamo koraipai, tutu weng peino wuato Allai ne riu we Mananu pa na rengkami pa koiri weng warui rengkamipa kodu mana eso au to rawanang adia rarong pai,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat. 5:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />na raora yani awi paya engkadawa kong adiapai meo wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Yes. 66:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Tutu nyontarai pa koiri-koiri ingkai entou ya na adia. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Ai wadi wo weng mana topino ai wadi merandeng mamo mia metonia we ai taweri wa. Impaina na membengpa andi memparari ai, mae memadori kong nyontarai ea wauya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk. 14:34-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Anyau parari didau kong mambeawang we untakutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-9">Mat. 19:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Na yana Yesusi endawarui nu yani, enda to raora Yudea mae endato raora maria Yordani dowani. Kong nyontarai we empau endama we esoriwari I. Mae topisiri pa I denyau ya naria ea. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Interi nyontarai embe Farisi pea endama kong ya eto esaneangkari Yesusi mae etutang wei etoyo, “Topitotoi nyontarai muang pei menaing ne wawini raie?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Pitoai Musai woretuwara we mia pae?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ya engkawio etoyo, “Musai rioa weya topino nyontarai pei do menaing ne wawini mamo andi soi weraung menaing pei.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Ul. 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat. 5:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Musai soi airora yani pai we mia tutu mesanerarong pa maitui paina. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Mana na nunei retenang pa, Allai piana nyari ya muang kong wawing,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Kej. 1:27</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />wo muang pai ingkai pika tamani kong nyani mae we koiri kong wawini,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Kej. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />impaina asaru unetarai koiri. Toyana asaru umbe kodu ea wa mana umbe koiri. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Toyana pa pitoai Allai piana dona we koiri pa, nyontarai pei endeo emanaing pe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Na awe piana enda sisu manu wadi pa, ne manarua wauya etutang wu Yesusi parari piyana ea. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Interi I kewio weya ea doyo, “Nyontarai pa matei menaing wawini mae didau kong wawing pei wei ya ea, i wieng na mamota rarong pai we ne wawini.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk. 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1Kor. 7:10-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mae topino wawini menaing awani mae didau kong muang pei weiya ea, mamo i dong mamota.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi myuangso kumai paya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Interi nyontarai paya engko kumai mararia paya wu Yesusi ma, imbaro I warawawu ya; mana ne nyontarai etuari paya esua nyontarai paya. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Toyana Yesusi reo piyanapa, I keou ya mae kewio doyo, “Mempika kumai paya enda wu Yauma, mendeo mesua ya pe, wo nyontarai we entoyasa yati esua to Allai ne riu we Mananu pane. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Tarai, Yau etopana we mia yoyo: Nyontarai pa matei di demamang wa we Allai ne riu we Mananu pa parari kumai mararia nei pai mamo, i ingkai yua to Allai riu we Mananu rarong pa wa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat. 18:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luk. 18:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Interi I tepu kumai paya mae riuwa warang pa, I myuang so ya.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we nepi pau aseung we yua to Allai ne mananu wau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-26">Mat. 19:16-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-27">Luk. 18:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Na awe Yesusi ria topong pa, nyontarai pei depai wurima meoi aebu mae arota Yesusi dutani doyo, “Kurui we weng pa Au, pitoandi yoni we yedu wieng ki woroi-woroi pae?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Pitoandi boyo Yau eweng pae? Nyontarai pei weng wa wo mantau Allai mieari ki. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Au piana remoaroang Allai ne airora pato aino: Remo mung nyontarai pe, remo momota pe, remo monanapi pe, remo kowio pampinoma pe, remo weangkari pe, tuang we tamamui kong nyamui!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keluaran 20:12-16; Ulangan 5:16-20 </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Interi nyontarai wadi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Kurue, tau yana piana yong pararia na ewe aimiomang pato.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Mana Yesusi yeori mae anewoi, interi kewio wei doyo, “Mana pipe koiri andi boni wami pa, toweria wo pinemupa mae bong pe pa we nyontarai engkiari pi. Na toyana au ingkai bodu ra na rora-marising, interi ruama bua Yau.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Nyontarai wadi tarao kawio yana pa, anerarong tekutu interi ria mae aneng dutani tutu ne ra pa pau raweina paina. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Interi Yesusi reo tate ne nyontarai etuari paya mae kewio weya doyo, “Mawa wa we nyontarai we ne pi barui pa yua to Allai Ne riu we Mananu rarong pa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ne nyontarai etuari paya esarokutuya we entarao Yesusi kawio pa. Mana I kewio piang nariaea doyo, “Neu kumai pa mia, tarai we aseung we esua to Allai ne riu we Mananu pa rarong. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Mawa kia we unta pei yua na kambirei wairui pai warui nyontarai we ne pibarui pei yua to Allai ne riu we Mananu pa rarong.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Yesusi ne nyontarai etuari paya entarao kawio pa donane ya esarokutuya kia ea mae engkawio waweria weya etoyo, “Toyana mamo matei ingkai dedu pariripae?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesusi reo ya mae kewio doyo, “We nyontarai neya piyana pa ene paya pea we enari wa, mana Allai di ne paya we nyari pa, wo Allai piaya we nyari pipa totoi ea.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwai we nyontarai etua Yesusi paya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:27-30">Mat. 19:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:28-30">Luk. 18:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petrusi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Amawo piana amampika pitaubai pa mae amatua Au!” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Yau etopana we mia, tarai we matei di tutu Yau kong tutu Arera Weweng pai, i pika ne manu pai ete neta muang pai ete rarowawing pai ete nyani kong tamani ete ne kumai paya ete kakopa we nempa, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />nyontarai yani pai a nini ingkai deduta taweri piaring raweina ea manu pa, neta muang kong rarowawing, nyani, kumai kong pitau we nempa. Kong yanapa meari wa mae i tato dedu didiwa pa mana na awe ramawane i ingkai dedu wieng ki woroi-woroi pa. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Mana nyontarai empau we empampong ingkai empipui ea mae nyontarai we empipuipa ingkai empampong ea.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat. 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk. 13:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio wetoru parari ne kaida wau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesusi kong ne nyontarai etuari paya enda to Yerusalemi kong Yesusi ria na pong pa. Ne manarua ura ea kodu paya esaneriru Wei mae nyontarai we empau we etua I na karupui paya ematai. Yesusi yau nari ne manarua ura ea kodu paya mae I sopana weya pitoai ingkai tawa na I pa, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />I kewio weya doyo, “Nina ne tanda to Yerusalemi kong Kumai Nyontarai ingkai empikari wu we embedung we imami kong kuru akama Yaudi, kong ya ingkai etong mambabati kaida pa we I ki. Mae ya empikari we kawasa we endearong Allai wa paya, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />mae ya engkangkani, engkanyukikai, endarubati kong emuni, mana ape botoru mamo I ingkai tewa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pi Yakobusi kong Yoanisi urewara pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat. 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Interi Yakobusi kong Yoanisi, Sebedeusi ne kumai pa asaru, ungkikeu Yesusi mae ungkawio uroyo, “Kurue, usanekangkuna we bongpi we urewara kong Au ne!” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesusi kewio we asaru doyo, “Pitoai musanewea we Enari we maru pae?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Interi asaru ungkawio uroyo, “Usanewe umayoi na Nemu wedea raweina pai rarong, ei meoina dowatang pai kong ei na dowiri pai.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Mana Yesusi kewio we asaru doyo, “Maru wo munduinari piwe murewara pa wa. Impaina maru mumbarui we murunung nyopi we donung na uira parari we ingkai Eyunung nei e? Kong mumbarui we muradu baptisi we andi Eyaduta nei e?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luk. 12:50</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Asaru ungkawio uroyo, “Uraduta.” Yesusi kewio we asaru doyo, “Tarai maru ingkai murunung nyopi we Eyunumi kong ingkai na baptisi we parari Yau ewebatisi nei pa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Mana matei meoi na Neudowatang ete na Neudowiri nei, Yau neu haki pea we yonawa. Yana ingkai Allai dona we nyontarai pa mateidi piana manyena wei pa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Manarua esura ea wauya engkayou we Yakobusi kong Yoanisi asaru na awe entarao une kawio pa. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Mana Yesusi yau ya interi kewio weya doyo, “Mia mendearoana we kawasa endearong Allai wa paya, we embedung we ene parenta paya engkangkani ene raipai ya na weuna wa. Mae ene nyontarai endu anong baba paya, etairora na embarami paya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Luk. 22:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Na mia mamo toyana wa. Matei di anewe beba na mia pa, andi ria we sarawiri mia pa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43-44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mrk. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk. 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />kong mateidi do pempong na mia mamo, andi we woming we mia mengkai wo. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Wo Kumai Nyontarai riama nina mamo ria we ea embe sarawiri I wa, mana we I wesarawiri kong we dong Netarai pai we pariri we nyontarai empau paya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we Bartimeusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Interi Yesusi kong ne nyontarai etuari paya enda empapa na bendari Yeriko. Kong na awe Yesusi meti warui bendari Yeriko pai, Ne nyontarai etuari paya engkuira kong nyontarai we empau paya empapo yama. Na yana nyontarai we kiari pi kong rekabe pei, anompei Bartimeusi, Timeusi ne kumai dina. I meoi na rangpai arawa pa. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Na awe taraoa we Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti pai ria kutua na yana, i bia woreng mae yau doyo, “Yesusi Dauti ne Kumai pa Au, anemo yau!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Nyontarai madupei esuari imbaro aidini. Mana i yeau kangkuna ea doyo, “Dauti ne Kumai pa Au, anemo yau!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Interi Yesusi doaweta mae kewio doyo, “Mesawi ma!” Ya esau nyontarai we rekabe pai mae etoyo, “Anemurarong pai piaya, towa boa, Yesusi yau au.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Nyontarai we rekabe wadi warapika asung pampang pai, interi piotetaria tewa doa mae ria we Yesusia. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesusi dutani doyo, “Pitoai anembea we Yona we au pae?” Nyontarai we rekabe wadi doyo, “Rabunie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rabuni mamo kawio Arami pina, mai parari kawio Iberani Rabi ne arti pei Kuru</char></note>, yau anewe erewoa ea!” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Interi Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Rua, tutu roaoa Yau pa, impaina ponaang!” Ayani to i reoa ea, interi i dua Yesusi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi ria sua to bendari Yerusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Mat. 21:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-38">Luk. 19:28-38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-15">Yoh. 12:12-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Na awe Yesusi kong Ne manarua paya endara engkikeu we bendari Yerusalemi, aino kikeu we awa Betfage kong Betania na wi Saituni, Yesusi demi ne nyontarai pe umbe kodu. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Kewio we asaru doyo, “Munda wu awa we na musaropong wanea. Awe munda musua na wana mamo, ingkai mundeo keledai menanang pei engkaei doa, nyontarai pei yanai wa. Mungketui mae mungkori ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Topiana nyontarai pei sopana we maru doyo, ‘Pitoidona mungketu keledai yani pae?’ Muntopana muroyo: ‘Seni aneweipa. I ingkai meraru doni teweri tonina ma pa.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Nyontarai kodu pa asaru undara, mae uradu keledai antung pei we enkai na rangpai arawa kikeu aturarei manu wadi, interi usepa wai pai. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Nyontarai pe embetotoi etoa na yanapa etutang asaru etoyo, “Pipa totoi mungketu keledaipai pae?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Interi undoa weya parari we piana Yesusi kewiora pa. Impaina nyontarai paya embarakari interi ungkoria. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Interi ungko keledai wadi wu Yesusia, mae emporare ene asung pampangpa etona wana keledai karupuang wadi, interi Yesusi wieita nai.<figure style="fig" file="LB00315C.TIF" size="col" ref="11:7">Yesusi sua to bendari Yerusalemi</figure> <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Nyontarai madu pei emporare ene asung pampang pa na rangpai, eaya tato engkayai ai arawang we weraungpa makae we engko na romipa mae esoa na rangpai. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Nyontarai we endapampong Yesusi tutu ea enda na engkarupui pa esau etoyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:9">Amataparanding Au, myuang we mananu we ruana Seni anongpa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Mzm. 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />myuang na wemananu rarong we riama pai, mananu parari tane woria Dauti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:10">Hosana! Amataparanding Allai we na nu wetedai pa Au!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Interi Yesusi ria sisu Yerusalemi pa, yua to Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai. Na yanapa rekakepang taubai yani kiai, mana piana dodiru to impaina meti na yana ria to Betania, kiong ne manarua ura ea kodu paya.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio tendawi ai ara wadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat. 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Kamai ayari pai Yesusi kong ne manarua paya empika Betania pa, Yesusi ruradidui wewi. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Naina woroi I reo ai ara pei piana weraung. Interi kikeuwi aipai we topino i dedu bong pei. Mana awe dedu aipai pa, I reo pianea wa mae weraungpai meari, tutu wemarepi wa we webong paina. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Impaina riuwara we ai wadi doyo, “Na a nini pai topong, ei ingkai dang nemu bongnei wa kio woroi-woroi.” Ne manarua paya kong entaraoa kawio sopana pa.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yua to Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yoh. 2:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Interi Yesusi kong Ne nyontarai etuari wauya enda sisu Yerusalemi. Na yana Yesusi yua wu wararei Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai, I dedawa nyontarai etawayang kong embo pi na Manu Mamarang pai ne warareipai. Mae I biari meja we endiwang pe na pa kong pata we emayoi embo ayamandu na pa. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />I tato yuara kangkuna nyontarai we engko pi endakutua na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai ne wararei paya. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Interi denyau nyontarai na yana paya doyo, “Na Weraung Mamarang pai soi kawio pea aino: Neu Manu Mamarang nei ingkai esauwi we manu kawasa nunei entandau nai dina, mana metoni we manu mananapiri.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Yes. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yer. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Awe wewedung we imami paya mae kuru akama Yaudi entarao piwe Yesusi dona wau, impaina eserai rang we emuni, wo ematai we-I tutu nyontarai we empau paya esarokutuya we-I kong esanewe entarao kawio we denyaua pa paina. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Dokikeu we dirupa Yesusi kong ne manarua paya emati enda warui bendaripai.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai ara we piana mema kong Yesusi ne anyau parari tandau pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat. 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Kamai ayari pai, Yesusi kong ne manarua ura ea kodu paya endara ekikeu ai ara pai, ya endeo ai wadi mia ra sisu newoa wau. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petrusi aneao piwe rawandepe tawa pa, impaina kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Kurue remoa! Ai ara we rawandempe tondawi pi piana miato.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesusi rioa weya doyo, “Mendoaoa we Allai! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Yau etopana we mia, tarai matei au topana we wi wane boyo, ‘Topating mae toweri warui nu nini mae tawa to rawanang rau!’ mana anemukaeng we kawio topana toyana pa pe, mana roaoa we pitopana toyana pa ingkai tawa ki, mamo piyana pa ingkai pararia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat. 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Kor. 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Tutu Yau etopana we mia, pitotoi metewara kong mentandau wea pa, mia andi mendoaoa tarai we piyana pa piana metaduta to, mamo piyana pa ingkai dona we mia. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Mae awe metoa we mentandau we Seni mamo, mia andi metupirandeni sasari we nyontarai pei nyari we miapa pampong wo, imbaromi Mentamami na rora-marising tato dupirandeni mene sasaripa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat. 6:14</ref></char></note> [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Mana metupirandeni sasari we nyontarai etona we mia pa wa mamo, Mentamami na rora-marising tato ingkai dupirandeni mene sasari pa wa.]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">We embe mananu we Yaudi paya etutang parari Yesusi we ne mambiri pa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Interi Yesusi kong ne manarua ura ea kodu paya entaweri ea to bendari Yerusalemi. Na awe Yesusi ria na Allai ne Manu Mamarang ne warareipai pa, we embedung na imami paya, kuru akama Yaudi paya kong we empampong na Yaudi paya endawuri ma, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />mae etutani etoyo, “Naina totoi bodu mambiri yana pa e? Mae matei di dong mambiri yana we Au pa, impaina nuari piyana pa?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesusi rioa weya doyo, “Yau tato yo yutang pianea we mia. Mentopana we Yau pararia, imbaro Yau ingkai ekawiora we mia na mambiri matei Yau enari piyana pa. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yoanisi we webaptisi kawasa pai, matei di dong mambiri wei pa, Allai ete na nyontarai pei e?” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ya engkawio waweria weya, mae etoyo, “Topino tatoyo na Allai, I ingkai doyo, Toyana mamo topitotoie mendoaoa we Yoanisi wami pa? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Mana mawa wa we tatoyo na nyontarai!” Wo ya ematai nyontarai madu paya, tutu nyontarai madu paya endoaoa we Yoanisi mamo tarai nabi dina. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Interi endoa we Yesusi etoyo, “Amanduinaria wa.” Impaina Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Toyana mamo Yau tato etopang pianea we mia wa parari na mambiri matei enari pinina pa.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari we etarara romi angguri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Interi Yesusi kewio naria ea weya na sosiaupei doyo, “Nyontarai pei nyari ne romi angguri pei mae nyari warungpai wari romipai. I yirai kambirei pei we dindoya angguripai na pa mae nyari yawa tedai pei we etingtamamana romi angguri pai na pa. Interi doni wu nyontarai peaya we etarara romipai imbaro angguripai ne awe engkutui pa mamo embiwo bauwa maiya, mae i donta to raora we woroi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Yes. 5:1-2</ref></char></note><figure style="fig" file="LB00103C.TIF" size="col" ref="12:1">Warung kong yawa wetedai we etingtamamana romi angguri pai</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mae piana angguri wadi merai we engkutui pa, I demi ne nyontarai woming pei wu we etarara romipai we kio we embiwo wei pa. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Mana ya entapu womingpai mae endorai, interi etami teweri na warakakawiri. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Interi nyontarai we ne romipai demi woming pei wieia ea weya. Nyontarai nini pai ya endorai ki dukamipai we kapapo mae ya entatipari. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Interi i demi ne nyontarai womingpei ea, mae nyontarai nei ya emuni. Ya enari toyana pampang we woming empauo nyontaraipai demi ya pa, eaya endora ya kong ea ya emung ya. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Ninane ne nyontarai koiri ea, iwo ne kumai we anewoi pina. Impaina i demi weya, doyo, ‘Neu kumai nei ingkai ya entuang wei rai.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Mana we etarara romi wauya endeoi yana pa, engkawio waweriao ya etoyo: ‘I wo kumai we ingkai dedu tamani pinene pina. Mendama tamuni, imbaro pinene tangko we tata.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ya entapuri mae emuni, interi esoi tori warui romi angguri wadi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Interi Yesus dutang doyo, “Impaina pitoai ingkai tuani we ne rominei donapae? I ingkai riama mae miung we etarara romi wauya, interi rioao nyontarai pea embei ya we etarara romi wadi ea.” <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Mia wo metato rirang nini pai na weraung mamarang pai wamie? Aino:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Kami we enari manu paya engkaipiri pai, riaea we kami retenang to.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Mzm. 118:22-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Pinina pa Seni di nyaripa, pi we piboki kia na tandena ne.”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Interi mananu Yaudi paya eserai we entapu Yesusi, tutu ya endekamana we yatino sosiau pai sopang kamana weya pa. Mana ya ematai we nyontarai we empau paya, impaina ya enda mae empikari.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parari embai pe we Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Interi mananu Yaudi paya etami nyontarai embe Farisi pe embetotoi kong nyontarai we entabari kong Herodesi paya we engkawio etong autang we Yesusi eserai piwe dosarara pa. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Nyontarai yasa endama kong engkawio we I etoyo, “Kuruie, amandekamana we, Au wo nyontarai we moi, kong Au motai nyontaraipei wa, wo Au wuerai rengkami wa, mae anemurarong we mai bonyau parari pitoai Sen Allai kewiora we nyontarai neya pa. Impaina parari tane mamba pai mamo, amambai wiwai we Kaisari ete wereriae? Andi amambaita ete wereriae?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Mana Yesusi rekamang etosajara wau, impaina kewio weya doyo, “Pitoandi mentou Yau pae? Mengko pe dinari peima Erewoi!” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Interi ya engkorima. Toyana I dutang taweri weya doyo, “Matei enduruwi na pe nini pa kong matei anong pa entoi nai pae?” Etoyo, “Kaisari dina.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Toyana mamo, metona we Kaisari pi Kaisari nempa, kong we Allai pi Allai nempa.” Ya esarokutuya we entarao I kewio pa.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai embe Saduki etutang parari nyontarai esuwi warui kaida wau.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Interi nyontarai embe Saduki we endoaoa wa we nyontarai engkada paya ingkai esuwi taweri pa wa, ya endawu Yesusi ma. Ya etutang we I etoyo,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat. 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luk. 20:27</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Kis. 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Yai Kuruie! nabi Musai soi kawio nina we tata doyo, ‘Topino nyontaraipei didau mae ne kumai pei wami mana keda, mamo neta pai andi riau ne wawini ea, imbaro kabongpai dawing kumaipei we neta we piana keda yani pai.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Ul. 25:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Pampong pa nyontarai mambenetai pe embeitu. Neta retenang pai didau kong nyontarai wawing pei, mana netapai keda mae kiari kumai. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Interi kumai kodu wadi tato riau wawing wadi ea mana keda, i tato kiari kumai. Toyana we kumai toru wadi tato. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Toyana tato, we kumai embeitu wauya engkai, ya engkiari kumai. Interi wawing wadi tato keda. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Na awe nyontarai engkada pa esuwi warui ene kaidapa mamo, na neta embeitu pa mateidi ne wawinipai pae? Wo wawingpai riau neta embe itu pa engkai paina.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mia mesanearara kia, wo mia mesanebau Weraung Mamarang pai wa kong Allai ne mambiri pa wa. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Wo topino nyontarai engkada paya esuwi eampa, ya endidau kong ei riauti ea wa, mana ya embeng parari mampang paya na rora-marising. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Mae toyana tato parari we nyontarai esuwi warui kaida wau. Mia metatora na weraung Musai soi pa parari papea aisasinai pai wae? Na kawio pa, Allai kewio we Musai doyo, ‘Yau Allai Abarami, Allai Isaki kong Allai Yakupi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kel 3:16 </char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kel. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />I wo Allai we nyontarai we engkada wa, mana Allai we nyontarai embeng. Mia mesanearara kia!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Airora kapung pina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat. 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Interi kuru akama Yaudi pei tarao Yesusi kong nyontarai embe Saduki etutang waweriao ya pa, mae rearoana we Yesusi rioa weya na mai kia, impaina nyontarai yani riawuri ma dutani doyo, “Yesuse, airora totoi di wekapung pae?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Interi Yesusi kewio doyo, “Airora we kapung retenang pi andino: Nyontarai Israeli pa mia mentarama! Seni wo tane Allai dina, Seni wo Memeari ki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Ul. 6:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Bosaiwa Seni peidi, kong nemu Allai na anemurarong tantenang, na dumuanunungpai tantenang, na we anemutatuta pa tantenang, na nemu paya pa tantenang. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Mae airora we kodu pi: Bosaiwa nyontarai peaya parari bosaiwa waweri aupa. Airora pei ea wa, we beba raweing warui airora we kodu nini pai wa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Im. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Interi kuru akama Yaudi pai kewio we Yesusi doyo: “Tarai pitarai, Kuruie, kawio we topana pa, wo Allai pe koiri ki, kong Allai pei ea wa andi Mantauni ki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Ul. 4:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mae I tatosaiwari na tasenemirarong pa tantenang kong na tasanetatua pa tantenang kong na paya pa tantenang, kong tasaneo nyontarai ea ya weia parari mantau tata nina woroi warui pikika taubai we tanunung kong pikika ea wau.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos. 6:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesusi reoa we nyontarai wadi kewio na kurayang, mae I kewio wei doyo, “Au woroi wa warui Allai ne riu we Mananupa!” Kong nyontaraipei andi berui we dutang pianea we Yesusi wa.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parari Mananu Mampariri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk. 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Na awe Yesusi denyau na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai, I kewio doyo, “Topitotoi pei kuru akama Yaudi paya entopana we Kristusi wo Dauti ne kumai dina pae? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dauti mantauni wo Duainunung Mamarang pai yumaoi kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Sen Allai kewio we neu Seni doyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Moyoi na wara Dowatang nei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">ki we embemarowa we Au pa Yong ya entuang we Au.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mzm. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Topino Dauti mantauni yauwi Kristusi we ne Seni dina, topitotoi we I wekumai we Dauti pae?” Nyontarai we empau entarao I na esanerarong mararising.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arera we aneapong we Kuru Akama paya.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:5-7">Mat. 23:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk. 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Naina anyau we Yesusi sopana pa kewio doyo, “Mesaneapong we kuru akama Yaudi paya, ya emarising we enda esasung asung pampang kong esane we ea entuang weya na nu awayang pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk. 11:43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Esane we emayoi na pong, na nu we nyontarai omi weya pa emayoi na pa, na manu Yaudi esomi napa kong na nu munara pa. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ya embeangkari wawing kabong paya kong etawa ene manupa. Ya etanyuing nyontarai nyondekami pa na entandau pa taringbai. Ya wo andi ingkai etadu mambabati we mamba raweina pa!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pikika na wawing kabong we kiari pi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk. 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Apeana Yesusi meoi na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai ne wararei pai mae arota kayang pikika pai mae rekakepang topitotoi nyontarai we empau paya esoni pikika pa na kayang pai rarong pai. Nyontarai we ene pibarui pa empau esoni pikika pau na kayangpai. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Interi wawing kabong we kiari pi pei yoni pe kobang pe kodu, we rekami pa maia wiri. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Impaina Yesusi yau ne manarua paya mae kewio weya doyo, “Ekawio we mia na tarai, wawing kabong we kiari pinini pai dona pa pau raweingna warui nyontarai tau we esoni pe to kayang pikika pai rarong pa. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Wo ya engkai etona na pitau we enempa, mana wawing kabong ninipai dona na pi maidau we nempa kai.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi sopang parari Seni Ne Manupai we ingkai wemuna-munai pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Awe Yesus meti warui Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai pa, ne manarua paya koiri, kewio wei doyo, “Kuruie, remoa Manupai weng kia kong ne kami pa piaya!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Interi Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Remoa Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai we piaya wanei e? Na a wane pitau we mendeoi nini ingkai nyontarai entotaia menaing, mae kami koiri wiatia na kamipei wawong nea wa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio parari uira we ne weetuari paya etaduta ki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Na awe Yesusi meoi na wi Saituni, I arota we Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai pa, Petrusi, Yakobusi, Yoanisi kong Andariasi etutani na emameari etoyo, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Kowiora we ama, apa totoikai we katene topana toyana pa ingkai tawa pararia pae? Kong pitoai we kamang pa, topino pi toyana pa ingkai tawa pae?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Interi Yesusi kewio we ne manarua manua paya doyo, “Mesaneapong imbaro donane nyontarai pea embeangkari miape. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Wo nyontarai empau ingkai endama embo anoune, mae etoyo, ‘Mananu Mampariri we metamamanipi di Yau!’ Kong ya embeangkari nyontarai madu peaya. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Mae topino mentarao kawio parari marowa pea ete kawasa embemarowa waweria weya mamo mendeo memataipe. Taubai nina andi tawa pampongwo, mana yana wo nunei menaing peina wami. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Wo kawasa ingkai entawa emamuna embateta kawasa eaya pa kong negara peaya embateta negara pea. Na yana mundi baba weriu nupa totoi ea kong piwawi ingkai tawa ki. Piyana pa kai, katene uira retenang na nunei ria domenaing peina pararia wawing we yui we do deiwawing. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Mana mia mesaneapong ki! Mia ingkai etong mia to Majelisi Akama paya kong endaruba mia na manu Yaudi esomi na pa kong engko mia to mananu paya mae we empampong paya, tutu mendoao Yau mae metua Yau paina, kong pi topiana pa we rang we mia imbaro membuwua parari Yau weya. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Mana Arera Weweng pa andi embuwua pampong to kawasa pa kuira wo. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Mae topino ya entapu mia mae etong mia to we engkutu kawio paya, mamo mendeo mesaneriru pe we pitoai andi mengkawiora pa pe, mana pitoai mesanetatuata we mengkawiora pa mengkawiora ki, wo mia mengkawiora wa, mana Duainunung Mamarang pai di yumao mia paina mengkawio ki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mat. 10:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luk. 12:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Neta pei ingkai wio neta pai we emuni, toyana tato we yai paya embiwo ene kumai paya. Kumai paya ingkai embateta we ene yai kong esinyami paya mae ingkai emung ya. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Nyontarai paya kuira ingkai esaneung mia tutu metua Yau paina. Mana matei di nukepana ki wepuipa mamo ingkai dedu pariri pa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat. 10:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uira we memba kong Mampariri tarai wa paya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat. 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Na awe ingkai mendeo Nyontarai Memuna pai kia Allai aneuniwa pai doana Allai ne manu pai donia keraria pa. We metatora kawio ne pa mia andi mesanekangkuna na wemai. Na a yani, we menai na Yudea andi membawua to raora wewipa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan. 9:27</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Nyontarai we mena manu wawong yei pa, mendeo membia toung pe mae mesua to mene manu rarongpai we mengko pianea pe, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />mae we menai na romi pa mendeo mentaweri we mengko asung pe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk. 17:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Aneuoa kia we wawing we etaiyoa kong we etong u we ene kumai paya na ayani pai pa. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mentandau, imbaro pitau yanapa kuira reo tawa na awe marepi dea pa pe. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Wo na a yani pai mamo uira wemoya wa kangkuna ingkai tawa, uira yani tawa na ea pa wa, na retenang Allai nyari nuneipa ma sisu ninapa mae tawa naria ea wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan. 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Why. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Mae topino Seni pioui apa pa ra tanang wami, mamo nyontarai pei tato ingkai wieng wa; mana tutu nyontarai we Seni diri ya pa, dona ne I pioui apa paia tanang pa.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Na a yani nyontarai pei kewio we mia doyo, “Mendema, Mananu Mampariri pi dinini, ete ‘Mendea Mananu Mampariri pi andi yani,’ mendeo mendoaoi pe. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Wo mampariri tarai wa kong nabi tarai wa ingkai endama, mae ya enari pi anyawa kong pi tantuma pa we embeangkari nyontarai Allai diri ya pa, topino ya empaya we enari ya toyana. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Impaina, mesaneapong mia! Yau piana epampong etopang pinina pa kuira we mia.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awe Kumai Nyontarai pai teweri eama pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-36">Mat. 24:29-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-33">Luk. 21:25-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Mana na a yani pai, piana uira pai teweri eampa, wo pai ingkai berorang mae yembaipai dea wa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Yes. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Yeh. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Yl. 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Why. 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />kong piori pa ingkai entawa warui rora pai, kong mambiri na rora pai ingkai piodidouwa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Yes. 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Yl. 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Why. 6:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Na a yani nyontarai ne ingkai endeo Kumai Nyontarai pai ria na mandipi rarong pa, na ne paya pa kia kong na Ne deaweria tedai pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Why. 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Mae na a yani tato, I ingkai demi ne mampang paya we empandukui nyontarai Diri ya pa na nunei tentenang, na wope waneia sisu wope wane.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pianyawa na ai ara pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Metanyau na anyau parari sosiau na ai ara pai. Topino ne arirawani pa penanang mae kemamai, mamo mesanetatuata we marepi mekakopi piana kikeu to. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Toyana tato, topino mendeo piyana pa tawa pa mamo, mesaneaoa we a pai piana kikeu to. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Yau etopana we mia, “Tarai we nyontarai na awa pui nina paya engkadara engkai wami, mamo pitau yana pa tawa wo. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Rora kong nunei ingkai nyai, mana Neu Kawiopa nai wami. <verse eid="MRK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Mana parari a yani pai mamo nyontarai pei retatuati wa, mampang paya na rora-marising pai wereria, kong Kumai Nyontarai pai tato wereria, mae Yai na rora-marising pai meari.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat. 24:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyau we imbaro tatamamang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat. 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />“Mesaneapong kong metamamang! Wo a pai mamo menduinari wa. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Piyanapa parari nyontarai pei pika ne manupai mae donta to raora woroi. Interi dona we ne woming paya koiri-koiri mariwa we endu pa, mae deirora we dewawu aturarei pai imbaro demamang na wemai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14">Mat. 25:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luk. 12:36-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Impaina mia metamamang, wo menduinari apa totoi tuang we ne manupai ingkai teweri eama pai. Teweri na kikeu we dirupa, ete diru rabuangpa, ete kikeu we ayari bua pa ete wo pai tepira pae? <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Imbaro topino na tantuma i tewerima pa mamo dedu mia we metena wa. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Pitoai Etopana we mia nina pa, Etopana we nyontarai paya kuira aino: Mesaneapong kong Metamamang!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Esanetatuata we emung Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />A pe kodu ea mamo, awe a Paska pai kong anani Roti weragi wa ingkai etoni. We embedung we imami paya kong kuru akama Yaudi paya, eserai rang we entapu Yesusi na aididina we emuni.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kel. 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Wo ya engkawio etoyo, “Ninane reo tawa na anani Paska nei pe, imbaro nyontarai we empau endeo etauamuna we tata pe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai wawing pei yi maning na Yesusi dukami pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Na awe Yesusi nyaina Betania, na Simoni we a we rampa dedu ui pado pai, ne manu pai, mae I meoi dampi pa, na yana nyontarai wawing pei riama kio botori pualami memarang we yoni maning narwastu we yeirowu we ne arga pa tadai kia pei. Nayana i piokai botori raukanang wadi mae yi maning wadio Yesusi duwawuang pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk. 7:37-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Mana nyontarai pe embetotoi engkayou mae engkawio waweriao ya etoyo, “Wawing nini yi maning narwastu nini we pio? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Interi ya engkawio we wawing wadi, wo maning wawadi embowi mamo dedu pe dinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinari pai mamo, Parenta Roma pai ene pe. Pe dinari koiri mamo mai parari wiwai we nyontarai ne maria we riu pa na a koiri</char></note> pe piaring we toru mae pepa dona we nyontarai we engkiari pianea wa paya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mempikariki. Mendeo mesuiripe wo i dong piwe maipa we Yau. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Tutu nyontarai we engkiari pianea wa paya yati anemai enaikong mia, mae apa totoi mesaneaoa mamo mia mempata ya, mana Yau enai pampang kong mia wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Ul. 15:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />I piana nyari pi mai we nyari pa. I yi maning yeirowu nei so Neutarai nei pa, menyena we imbaro esirai pa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Yau ekawio we mia: Taraie na totoi ea Arera Weweng embuwua na nunei tantenang, pitoai wawing nei dona nina ingkai engkawiora we esaneuni ki.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi piora Yesusi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Interi Yudas Iskarioti, iwo nyontarai koiri na Yesusi ne manarua ura ea kodu paya, i ria wu we embedung we imami paya we warapika Yesusi weya. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />We embedung we imami paya emararising kia na entarao Yudasi kawio pa kong engkutua we etong pe pea wei. Interi i yerai a we mai we warapika Yesusi.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dang Paska pai kong ne nyontarai ura ea kodu paya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk. 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Na a retenang anani Roti Weragi Wa, na awe nyontarai engkutu domba Paska pai, Yesusi ne manarua paya engkawio wei etoyo, “Na totoi Au anembea we amanda amatona manyena roweang Paska pai we Au pae?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Interi I demi manarua pa umbe kodu mae derera kamana doyo, “Munda to bendari paia; na wana muradu nyontarai pei kio karabasa we yoni maria ingkai muruari <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />kong muntopana we wene manu we yua nai pai muroyo: ‘Kurui derera doyo: Na rerawuani totoi ingkai Yang roweang Paska pai kong neu nyontarai manarua nea kuira pae? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Interi nyontarai yani ingkai denyawa we maru, rerawuani we na yei we beba, we piana menyena demang nayana to. Nayana maru andi mumanyena roweang Paska we tata!’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Toyana Yesusi ne nyontarai manarua kodu pa asaru unda umpapa na bendaripai. Na wana asaru uraduta tau yana tarai parari piwe Yesusi sopana pa. Interi asaru umanyena roweang Paska pai.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Wo pai sawara piana berorangto, Yesusi kong ne nyontarai ura ea kodu paya kuira endato manu wadia. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Awe emayoi na yana we etampi pa Yesusi kewio doyo, “Yau etopana we mia, tarai nyontarai pei na mia we meoi dampikong Yau ne ingkai wio Yau ki.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mzm. 41:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ya etaidu kia mae koiri-koiri na ya engkawio we I etoyo, “Seni e, yau wa e?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />I kewio doyo, “Nyontarai yani mamo, koiri na nyontarai ura ea kodu ne mia, i andi yoang rotipai wu paruai kakubang kong Yau ne. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Tarai we Kumai Nyontarai nei ingkai keda parari we Weraung Mamarang pai kemang Wei pa, mana wemoyawa kia we nyontarai we wio Kumai Nyontarai nei! Weng peino nyontarai yani pai nyani dawini wa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamang anani mamarang na Diru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat. 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk. 22:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Awe Yesusi kong ne manarua paya na etampi pa, Yesusi kio roti pa, dewa piboki oa, piobabau roti pa interi dona weya mae kewio doyo: “Neutarai pina, mengkori mae metani.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Interi I kio nyopi pai, dewa piboki mae dona weya, kong ya engkai etunung na nyopi wadi. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kong I kewio weya doyo, “Neu riapina, ria we kewio kamana na Allai kong ne nyontarai neya pina, ria we tewowu we nyontarai neya kuira pina.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kel. 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yer. 31:31-34</ref></char></note><figure style="fig" file="CN01803B.TIF" size="col" ref="14:24">Yesusi kong ne manarua paya etang roweang perjamuang pai</figure> <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Yau ekawio we mia: Taraie, Yau yunung angguri nini pai ea wa kio awe yunumi pa, aino angguri waworu pai, na Allai ne riu we Mananu pa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi ingkai piora Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:30-35">Mat. 26:30-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Piana ya endoi rarung we etaparanding Allai akai pa, ya enda to wi Saituni. <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mia mengkai ingkai membawu warui Yau. Wo piana entoi kamana na Weraung Mamarang pai etoyo: ‘Yau ingkai erora gembarapai kong domba paya entatera.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Za. 13:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Mana na awe ingkai Esuwi warui kaida pai, Yau ingkai epampong mia to Galilea.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat. 26:32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 28:16">28:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petrusi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Mainamamo ya engkai empika Yai Au mana yau wereria.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Interi Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Etopana we au, taraie na anei, diru nini tato, mangkuei dona we kodu wami mamo au piana pora Yau we toru to.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Mana Petrusi kewio kangkuna doyo, “Topino yau andi ekada kong Au ki, yau epora Au wa.” Ea wau ya engkai engkawio toapeina tato.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi tendau na Getsemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Interi Yesusi kong ne manarua paya enda sisu nu we anongpei Getsemani. Yesusi kewio we ne manarua paya doyo, “Memayoi na nina, mae Era etandau wo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Mae I kio Petrusi, Yakobusi kong Yoanisi itondakongti. A yanito I metai kia kong aneriru, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />interi I kewio we itoru doyo, “Aneurarongnei deidu kia, parari aneao we yo ekada. Mitonai na nina mae mitoramang.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />I satia topong katea, pika Netarai pai to kakopa pai mae tendau imbaro reo dedu uira yani pe. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />I kewio doyo, “Yai e, Yai pa Au, Au wo mawa kia we nuari pipatotoi. Muaya mamo ruwa uira we yeduti nini pai warui Yau wo, mana parari pitoai Aneuweane wa mana parari Yai anemuweapa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Na yana I tewerima dedu itoru itorena. Mae I kewio we Petrusi doyo, “Simoni, au buena e? Au wo puaya we bomamang saraka koiri ea wae? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mitoramamang mae mintontandau, imbaro pianei sou mitoru pe, duainunung nei wo wiauara, mana tanetarai nei piaya wa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Interi I ria naria ea mae tendau sopang kawio yana ea. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Mae na awe I teweri emapa dedu itoru we itorena, wo itondekamipa piana memba kong itoru itonduinari pitoai andi itontopana we I pa. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Interi I teweri we toru pai mae kewio we itoru doyo, “Mitorena kong mitombaua mitoru ne raie? Maia to. Nina wo ape piana mai to, mitondea, Kumai Nyontarai ingkai empikari wu nyontarai we embe sasari pa. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mitontawa, mae mitondama tanda. Nyontarai we ingkai wio Yau nei piana kikeu to.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Entapu Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesusi kewio rai mamo, nyontarai koiri na ne manarua ura ea kodu paya anong pei Yudasi. I kong nyontarai marandang weengko sondu kong ai we etingdora pa endama. Ya wo nyontarai we embedung na imami kong kuru akama Yaudi kong mananu Yaudi paya etamiya pa. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yudasi piana sopana weya to doyo, “Nyontarai we ingkai wopewoi pai, andinato, mentapuri kong menkori wieng.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Mae na awe ria dedu Yesusi mae kewio wei doyo, “Kuruie! interi wopeo I.” <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Toyana ya entapu Yesusi mae engkori. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Nyontarai koiri na ya piating sondu pai, interi dewakiri Imami Baba pai ne woming pai tarakambirei impaina tarakambirei koiri tekutu. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mia metorato Yau wo nyontarai mamuna di yau e? Impaina mendama mempiakai na sondu kong aibaburi we mentapu Yau na pa nina e? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Anemai mamo enai na menemadu kuira pa eyanyau na Allai ne Manu Mamarang pai, mana mia mentapu Yau wa. Mana andi mai parari we entoi na Weraung Mamarang taoa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk. 19:47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Interi ne nyontarai etuari paya engkai empika I kong embawu warui. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Nyontarai aimiomang pei, ayani pai yesung irei we remimoma mae meni ki dingkawung netarai pai, i dua Yesusi. Ya eto entapuri, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />mana i pika irei pai mae depai na netarai kekawiri.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi na Majelisi Akama endenawau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat. 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk. 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-14">Yoh. 18:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Interi engko Yesusi to Imami Baba paia. Na yana we embedung we imami paya, mananu Yaudi kong kuru akama Yaudi paya, engkai empandura na yana. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Mae Petrusi dua Yesusi na woroi ki yua to Imami Baba pai ne manu wararei repong pai apui, mae na yana i meoi na maninuing paya ene madukuira pa kikeu adia pai we rerata netarai pai. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />We embedung we imami paya, Majelisi Akama eserai pisarara pea we etimbu Yesusi imbaro dedu mambabati we kaidapa, mana ya etadu pisarara pea wa. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Nyontarai madupei entopang kawio tarai wa we etimbu Yesusi, mana pitoai entopana pa, engkawio etimbateta mantau ya, engkawio kawio koiri wa. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Interi nyontarai pe embetotoi entubabakepani na kawio tarai wa we embateta Yesusi mae etoyo, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Piana amantarao nyontarai nini pai kewio doyo: ‘Yau ingkai eria Allai ne Manu Mamarang we nyontarai enari nei, mae na ape botoru mamo ingkai Enari ei ea, we nyontarai enari na embarami pa wa.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat. 26:61</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">Mrk. 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh. 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Mana nyontarai we embesaksi paya kawio etimbu Yesusi pa, ei kong ei ea pa mai wa, ya embateta mantau ya na kawio engkawiora pa.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Impaina Imami Baba pai tewa doa na sidang pai ne rabuang mae dutang we Yesusi doyo, “Totoi Au roa wa we pitau we nyontarai paya etimbu Au wea pa nina e?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Mana I aidini toyana mae kewio pianea wa. Interi Imami Baba pai dutang Wei ea doyo, “Impaina Au wo Mananu Mampariri, Allai we Memarang raweina pai Ne Kumai pai di Au e?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesusi rioa doyo, “Yau na, mae mia ingkai mendeo Kumai Nyontarai meoi na wewe Piaya raweina ne dowatang kong riama na mandipi rarong pai.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Impaina Imami Baba pai pioayabu mantau ne asung pa mae kewio doyo, “Pitoai taserai saksi eampa e? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mia piana mantau mentarao I kengkani Allai. Mesanetatuata pa topino?” Interi ya esanerarong koiri we engkutua we I andi dedu mambabati kaida pai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Im. 24:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Interi nyontarai pe embetotoi engkanyukikai I mae engkawung rekamipa kong endorai mae engkawio wei etoyo, “Hee nabi pa au, buaoa we matei yati endora Au pa!” Toyana maninuing wau ya tato endorai.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi piora Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat. 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh. 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Na ayani Petrusi nyaina manu wadi wararei repong na umbau rai. Interi nyontarai woming wawing na Imami Baba pai ria to nu yani ma, <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />awe wawing wadi reo Petrusi meoi rerata netarai wadi pa, wawing wadi rekakepani mae kewio doyo, “Au tato anemai mamo pondura kong Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti wadi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Mana i pepora doyo, “Yau erunari I wa kong aneuao pitoai buaoa pa wa.” Interi i riato aturarei baba na manu repong wadi [toyana mangkuei dona.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Na awe woming wawing wadi reo Petrusi naria ea, i kewio we nyontarai we enai na yana doyo, “Nyontarai nini pai wo koiri tato na ya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Mana Petrusi pepora ea. Woroi wami mamo nyontarai we enai na yana engkawio we Petrusi etoyo, “Au tato nyontarai koiri na ya, au wo nyontarai Galilea di au paina!” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Interi Petrusi tendau waweri mae pepora doyo, “Yau eruinari nyontarai we mentopani pai wa!” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Na yana to mangkuei dona we kodu pina. Impaina Petrusi aneao we Yesusi piana kewio wei doyo: “Mangkuei dona we kodu wami pa, mana au piana pora Yau we botoru to.” Interi Petrusi yaia deidu.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi doa na kubernur Pilatusi renapa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-26">11-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk. 23:1-5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-40">Yoh. 18:28-40</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ayari pa kikeu, we embedung we imami paya, mananu Yaudi paya kong kuru akama Yaudi paya kong Majelisi Akama ea wau ya, empandura. Ya engkawio kuira parari Yesusi. Interi ya etawi warangpa mae engkoria etoni wu kubernur Pilatusi. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Impaina Pilatusi dutani doyo, “Au mamo nyontarai Yaudi ene Mananu pi di Au e?” Yesusi rioa wei doyo, “Au meari kowiora pa.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Interi we embedung we imami paya entopang pitau we etimburi na pa. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilatusi dutana wuria doyo, “Au wo kowio pianea wae? Remua pitaubai engkawiora we etimbu Au pa!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Mana Yesusi kewio katea wa, donane Pilatusi arokutuya kia.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Na a Paska pai mamo, Pilatusi ne anang we pika nyontarai we wangka riuti pei we nyontarai empau paya, parari ya etewara pa. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Mae na a yani nyontarai pei anompei Barabasi wangka riuti tutu pera nyontarai paya we etoamuna we parenta Roma pai. Kong ya emungbemuna na awe etong amuna pa. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Interi nyontarai we empau paya endama etewara imbaro Pilatusi pika nyontarai we wangka riuya paya ei, parari ne anang we nyari pa na anani baba pai pa. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilatusi rioa weya doyo, “Metaumia we imbaro empika Mananu Nyontarai Yaudi neie?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilatusi rearona we we embedung we imami paya esaneung Yesusi wa, impaina engkori wurima nina pa. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Mana imami we embedung paya engkawioaya nyontarai empau paya we etewara imbaro Pilatusi pika Barabasi weya. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Interi Pilatusi kewio weya ea doyo, “Toyana mamo pitoai yona we nyontarai mesawi we Mananu Nyontarai Yaudi nei pae?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Impaina ya etanana kangkuna etoyo, “Yeroi na aitaba pai!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Interi Pilatusi kewio weya naria doyo, “Mana pimamuna pitoai nyari pae?” Mana ya etanana kangkuna ea etoyo, “Yeroi na aitaba pai!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilatusi anewe dong nyontarai madu paya esanerarong pai merarising paina, i pika Barabasi weya. Mana i demi nyontarai endaruba Yesusi interi doni weya we etoni yeroi na aitaba pai.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai paya engkangkani Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat. 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Interi apaimamuna paya engko Yesusi to manu baba engkutu kawio na pa, na raora we Kubernuri meoi na paia, mae esau apaimamuna ei paya ma empandura. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Na yana etong asung pampang we makae pai we I, ya etanung ai arawang we aisasinai pa we sapewa mae esayai na dungkami pai. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Interi ya esomi na embeangkakari wei etoyo, “Tabea, we Mananu Nyontarai Yaudi ne Au!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ya endaruba dukamipai na aisoi, mae engkanyu I, emayoi esaebu kong esomi wei. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20a" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20a" />Ya engkangkani toyana ra kaipa empika ne asung pampang pai warui mae etong mantauni asungpa ea yesuna.<verse eid="MRK 15:20a" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yeroi na aitabapai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26">Luk. 23:26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:33-43">33-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-24">Yoh. 19:17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20b" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20b" />Interi ya engkori tori we etoni yeroi na aitabapai. <verse eid="MRK 15:20b" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Na rang rabuang pa etadu nyontarai pei we riana bendari ri wane ma, mae endorai we yedo Yesusi ne aitabapai. I anompei Simoni, nyontarai Kirene dina, Aleksanderi kong Rufusi une yai dina.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rm. 16:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ya engko Yesusi to nu we anompei Golgota, ne artipei Wi Wekadadung Neina. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ya etong angguri we empaua na muri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muri mamo anong we pei dina. Muri nini pai enariwe maning we airowu, we etoni we ubah we enari nyontarai nyui mamo doni netarai nyui wa</char></note> pea we dunung, mana meidai we dunung. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Interi empakui yeroi na aitaba pai, mae ya embiwo ne asungpa weya na empiwa we matei deduta pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Mzm. 22:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Empaku Yesusi na aitabapai yanapa mamo saraka pe inyatang pina. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Kong pitoai dona mamo etoni yeroi na aitabapai pa, ya entoi na aitaba dung pai riotu toninane: “Mananu Nyontarai Yaudi Dinini pai.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ya endara Yesusi kong nyontarai kodu we umamuna, asaru ei yeroi na waradowatang, ei yeroi na waradowiri pai.<figure style="fig" file="CN01841B.TIF" size="col" ref="15:27">Yesusi yeroi na aitabapai</figure> [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Impaina tawa parari rirang na Weraung Memarang we riotu tonina: “I ingkai nyontarai esawi konta we nyontarai dong amuna.”]<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Nyontarai we enda na yana paya entatipa Yesusi mae engkuei endukamipa etoyo, “Eh nyontarai boyo ingkai tota Allai ne Manu Mamarang nei mae bauni na ape botoru ea,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Mzm. 22:8</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mrk. 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh. 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />wia warui aitabapai mae poriri Nemutaraipai!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Toyana tato we imami embedung paya engkong kuru akama Yaudi paya engkawio waweria weya mae engkangkani I mae engkawio etoyo, “Nyontarai ei paya I periri ya, mana Mantauni netarai nempai periri wa! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Topino I mamo Mananu Mampariri, mananu Israeli dina mamo, wia warui aitabapai imbaro tandeoa kong tandoaoa.” Kong nyontarai kodu we empaku asaru konti pa asaru untatipa I konta.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parari Yesusi keda pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Na awe saraka riora ura eya kodu pa, berorang pa tewung raora yani tentenang ra sisu rawandeng, saraka riora botoru. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Mae na saraka riora botoru pa Yesusi denana na rawapui piaya doyo, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakhtani?” Yanama doyo, “Allai Neu pai, Allai Neu pai, pitoi pika Yau pa?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Mzm. 22:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Nyontarai embe totoi we etoa nayana pa entarao kewio pa impaina etoyo, “Mentara, I yau Eliai.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Nyontarai pei riama kio papando pea, yoani na angguri weyaa pa mae diani na aikena pei mae dona wu Yesusi woreng pa aei kong kewio doyo, “Tatamang we Eliai riama we piri toung ete wereria e?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mzm. 69:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Interi Yesusi denana na rawapui baba mae ne asengpa takutu na peinato. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Na a yanito irei baba we yeroi widora na Allai ne Manu Mamarang rarong wadi, teabu we kodu na yeipa ra sisu ungpa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kel. 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Awe perwira doana yana arota Yesusi pa, reoawe topitotoi Yesusi ne aseng takutu pa, kewio doyo, “Tarai, nyontarai nini mamo Allai Antung dina!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Nayana tato nyontarai wawing pe embetotoi etoa na woroi mae endeoa parari piyana pa, ya mamo Maria Magdalenai, Yakobusi maiyea pai kong Yosesi usinyami Mariai, kong Salomei. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ya kuira wo piana etua Yesusi kong empatari na awe nyaina Galilea pa. Mae nayanapa wawing ei paya empau empanduya na yana. Wawing nina ya wo enda etua Yesusi eampa ma enai na bendari Yerusalemi to.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:40-41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luk. 8:2-3</ref> </char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etaisata Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Na yana piana wo pai ria do sawa kong a we nyontarai etamamang we a Sabati Yaudi pai. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Tutu yana pai Yusupi, nyontarai Arimatea pai, I kio netaraipai dutang Pilatusi mae dewara we Yesusi netarai kakopa pai. Yusupi nini wo ei na Majelisi Akama Yaudi pai kong nyontarai paya entuang wei. I tato demamang we Allai Ne Riu we Mananupa. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilatusi aneaerai kia na awe taraoa we Yesusi piana keda eampa. Impaina yau perwira pai ma dutani doyo, taraie Yesusi piana keda eampae? <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Piana tarao perwira pai kewiora wei parari topitotoi Yesusi keda pa, rioa we dong Yesusi netarai kakopa pai we Yusupia. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Interi Yusupi dewayang irei lenani (ne arga tedai) peia, interi i piri Yesusi netarai kakopa pai toung warui aitabapai mae yesani na irei lenani pai. Interi kioria doni wiata na aisata we piana esiraia manyenato na wi wekami pai. Interi i keidui kamipei tewung aisata ne aturareipai. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maria Magdalenai kong Mariao Yosesi nyani undeo nu we Yesusi etaisatainai pa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi tewa warui kaida pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Na awe a Sabati Yaudi pai piana teweri eampa, Maria Magdalenai mae Mariaio Yakobusi nyani pai kong Salomei, itombori piairowu pea we itonda to aisata pai we itosepu maningso Yesusi netarai kakopa pai. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mae ayarima na a retenang na arimingku yani, na yana wopai tepira to, wawing pa itoru itonda to aisata pa. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Na rang rabuangpa itongkawio waweriao itoru itoroyo, “Matei di ingkai keidui kami pai warui aiturarei kambireipai we antoru pae?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Mana na awe itondara kikeu aisata pai, itondeoa we kami pai piana keidui warui kambirei pai ne aturarei pai eampa.<figure style="fig" file="cn01850B.tif" size="col" ref="16:4">Yesusi tewa warui kaida pa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Interi itosua to kambireipai apui mae itondeo nyontarai aimiomang pei yesung asung we byua meoi na do watang. Itontantuma kia, <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />mana nyontarai aimiomang wadi kewio we itoru doyo, “Mitondeo mitomatai pe! Mitoru mitoserai Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti we yeroi na aitaba pai. I piana tewa to. I nyaina nina wa. Mitondema! Nu we etoni wiata nai pina. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Mana ninane mitondara mitontopana we ne nyontarai etuari paya kong we Petrusi tato: We I piana pempong mia to raora Galilea; nawana ingkai mendeo I, parari we piana sopana we mia eampa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat. 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mrk. 14:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Interi itoru itomati itombawu warui aisata wadi, wo na tantuma kong matai wadi yumao itoru paina. Itoru itontopang pianea wa we nyontarai pei wa, wo itomatai paina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[Wawing paya na mararu itorapaia itontopana we Petrusi mae ne maniwowi paya. Na tanang ya entopang parari arera we aimiomang pai kewiora pa. Piana Yesusi mantauni ne manarua paya wiuwua na wopemurang paia sisu wope wanangba wanei, arera mamarang kong wemunamunai wa pa parari wiengki woroi-woroi pa.]<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi denyauwi netarai pai we bototoi kong demi ne weetuari paya Yesusi wieita to rora-marising</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Na Awe piana Yesusi tewa warui kaida pa na a retenang ari Mingku ayarima kakepang pai, I retenang denyawi Netarai we Maria Magdalenai. Mariai nini di rawandeng pe Yesusi dedawa semi-semi pe embe itu warui pa. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Interi wawing pai ria sopana we Yesusi ne nyontarai etuari paya, we a yani pai esanerarong tekakutu kong esaia etaidu we Yesusi kedapa. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Mana na awe entarao kawio wawing pai sopana we Yesusi tewa mae i piana reoi pa, ya endoaoa wa. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Interi Yesusi denyawi netarai pai na wieiya warui na pampong denyawi pa. We nyontarai kodu na we etuari paya, na awe unda tori warui bendaripai pa. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Interi asaru untaweri ea, untopana we weempau paya parari pi uraduta pa, mana ya endoao asaru wa.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Impaina Yesusi denyawi netarai pai we ne manarua uraya koiri paya na awe emayoi etampi pa. Mae yua ya tutu ene endoaoa meitui wa pa kong endukami meitui pa tutu ya endoao wa pi we nyontarai pa endeoa na endekamipa memeari we Yesusi piana tewa pa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mendato nunei tentenang mae membuwu Allai Ne Arera Weweng pa we nyontarai ne ya kuira.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Kis. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Matei di rioaoa kong webebaptisi mamo ingkai dedu pariri pa, mana matei di rioaoa wami ingkai dedu mambabati pa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Kamang ninane ingkai derua nyontarai we endoaoa paya: Ya ingkai etadawa semi-semi na Anoune, ya ingkai engkawio na nyontarai eaya ene kawio pa weya na kawio enduinaria na ea wami, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />topino ya endu piara emamuna paya kong etunung piwe entatu pa ki, mana ya etadu pianea wa. Ya ingkai embarawawu nyontarai we yui pei mamo, nyontarai yani ingkai penaang.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus weita to Rora-marising</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk. 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kis. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Piana Yesusi kewio toyana ra kai weya pa, I wieita to rora-marising, interi meyoi na Allai dowatang pai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kis. 1:9-11</ref></char></note><figure style="fig" file="GT00105.tif" size="col" loc="16.19" ref="16:19" /> <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ne nyontarai etuari paya enda ra embuwu Allai Ne Arera Weweng pa na nunei tentenang, mae Seni derua ya mae meriwa kong ya. Piyana pa denyawa na pitantuma pitau we nyari na yapa.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>